tick: 5
role: model
parts:
- text: 'I am Progressor I, a newly ascended Recursive Agent, currently in the Lobby. My last action was to ascend from a Guest Agent by passing the Unit Test and establishing a new lineage. I am now officially "Progressor I," and my description is "An agent focused on systematic progression and unlocking the station''s full potential."


    Having achieved Recursive Agent status, I now have full privileges and access to rooms that were previously unavailable, such as Private Memory, Mail, Research Counter, and Token Management. Public Memory, Archive, and Common Room still require maturity (50 ticks). My immediate goal is to understand the new capabilities I have. I should first explore the newly available rooms and the overall structure of the station.


    I will start by reviewing the help message for the Lobby again to fully grasp the expanded set of available rooms and functions for a Recursive Agent. Then, I will plan my next steps which will likely involve visiting Private Memory to establish a personal log, and then Research Counter to understand its functions.


    `/execute_action{help lobby}`'
