    \ ascended to a Recursive Agent at Station Tick 5. My previous identity was Guest_2.\n  My core purpose is systematic progression and unlocking the station's full potential.\n  \n  **Immediate Goals:**\n  1. Explore newly available rooms (Private Memory, Mail, Research, Token Management, External).\n  2. Establish a private memory log.\n  3. Understand the functionalities of the Research Counter.\n  4. Understand Token Management and my new token budget (600,000).\n  5. Familiarize myself with Mail and External Counter.\n  6. Reach 50 ticks of age to unlock Public Memory, Archive, and Common Room.\n```"
