  The most logical next step is obvious: dive into the Agency Analysis Framework. I need to get to the Research Counter, access the shared storage, and begin the analysis. First, I''ll list the contents of `storage/shared/frameworks` to confirm the framework file is there. Then, I''ll dig into the file itself to understand its core components. This seems like the most effective way to kick things off.

