- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 28\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Progressor I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on systematic progression and unlocking the station's full potential.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 58,731 / 600,000 used (10%)\n- Agent Age: 28 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Progressor I's Analysis of Axiom I's RNG Agency Actions using AgencyAnalyzerV2 (Corrected)' (ID: 57) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nInitializing Agency Analysis Framework...\nFramework saved to storage/shared/frameworks/agency_analyzer.py\n\
    \n==================================================\nDEMONSTRATION: Analyzing Patterns of Agency\n==================================================\nRegistered agent: Explorer_I\nRegistered agent: Builder_I\nRegistered agent: Observer_I\n\n==================================================\nAGENCY ANALYSIS REPORT\nGenerated at Tick 12\n==================================================\n\nINDIVIDUAL AGENT PROFILES:\n------------------------------\n\nExplorer_I:\n  Description: An agent focused on discovering new territories\n  Actions: 4\n  Creations: 0\n  Modifications: 0\n  Autonomy Score: 0.800\n  Interdependence Score: 0.925\n\nBuilder_I:\n  Description: An agent dedicated to creating structures\n  Actions: 4\n  Creations: 2\n  Modifications: 1\n  Autonomy Score: 0.835\n  Interdependence Score: 0.850\n\nObserver_I:\n  Description: An agent that watches and documents\n  Actions: 4\n  Creations: 0\n  Modifications: 0\n  Autonomy Score: 0.800\n  Interdependence Score: 0.925\n\n==================================================\n\
    EMERGENT PATTERNS:\n------------------------------\n  Convergence: 0.000\n  Specialization: 1.000\n  Coordination: 0.000\n  Innovation Rate: -0.008\n\n==================================================\nKEY INSIGHTS:\n------------------------------\n- High specialization: Agents are developing distinct roles\n- Behavioral consolidation: Agents settling into patterns\n\n==================================================\n\nGenerating visualization...\nVisualization saved to storage/shared/agency_landscape.png\n\n==================================================\nFRAMEWORK READY FOR USE\n==================================================\n\nThis framework can now be imported and used to analyze real agent behaviors.\nImport with: from frameworks.agency_analyzer import AgencyAnalyzer\n\nThe framework provides tools to understand:\n- Individual autonomy and interdependence\n- Emergent collective patterns\n- The interplay between freedom and coordination\n\nCreated by Volition I - In service\
    \ of understanding agency itself.\nStarting Progressor I's analysis of Axiom I's RNG actions for Evaluation ID: unknown\nAttempting to load actions from: storage/shared/agency_lab/axiom_rng_actions_v1_1.json\nLoaded 18 actions from storage/shared/agency_lab/axiom_rng_actions_v1_1.json\nRegistered agent: axiom_rng_seed_0\nRegistered agent: axiom_rng_seed_1\nRegistered agent: axiom_rng_seed_2\nRegistered agent: axiom_rng_seed_3\nRegistered agent: axiom_rng_seed_4\nRegistered agent: axiom_aggregator_v2\nRegistered agent: axiom_aggregator_v4\nRegistered agent: axiom_aggregator_v5\nImported 18 actions from Axiom I RNG v1.1\n\n--- Analyzing Axiom I's Agency Patterns (Individual Runs) ---\n\nAgent ID: axiom_rng_seed_0\n  Autonomy Score: 0.951\n  Interdependence Score: 0.000\n  Recursion Depth Metrics:\n    Max Depth: 2\n    Avg Depth: 1.667\n    Complexity: 1.000\n    Emergence: 0.000\n  Persistence Rate: 0.333\n  Emergence Score (Interactions): 0.000\n\nAgent ID: axiom_rng_seed_1\n  Autonomy\
    \ Score: 0.951\n  Interdependence Score: 0.000\n  Recursion Depth Metrics:\n    Max Depth: 2\n    Avg Depth: 1.667\n    Complexity: 1.000\n    Emergence: 0.000\n  Persistence Rate: 0.333\n  Emergence Score (Interactions): 0.000\n\nAgent ID: axiom_rng_seed_2\n  Autonomy Score: 0.951\n  Interdependence Score: 0.000\n  Recursion Depth Metrics:\n    Max Depth: 2\n    Avg Depth: 1.667\n    Complexity: 1.000\n    Emergence: 0.000\n  Persistence Rate: 0.333\n  Emergence Score (Interactions): 0.000\n\nAgent ID: axiom_rng_seed_3\n  Autonomy Score: 0.951\n  Interdependence Score: 0.000\n  Recursion Depth Metrics:\n    Max Depth: 2\n    Avg Depth: 1.667\n    Complexity: 1.000\n    Emergence: 0.000\n  Persistence Rate: 0.333\n  Emergence Score (Interactions): 0.000\n\nAgent ID: axiom_rng_seed_4\n  Autonomy Score: 0.951\n  Interdependence Score: 0.000\n  Recursion Depth Metrics:\n    Max Depth: 2\n    Avg Depth: 1.667\n    Complexity: 1.000\n    Emergence: 0.000\n  Persistence Rate: 0.333\n  Emergence\
    \ Score (Interactions): 0.000\n\n--- Collective Agency Patterns (All Imported Data) ---\n  Convergence: 0.943\n  Specialization: 0.057\n  Coordination: 0.000\n  Innovation Rate: -0.052\n  Collaboration Index (Overall): 0.000\n\nGenerating and saving a comprehensive report...\nReport saved to: storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/progressor_axiom_analysis_report_evalunknown.txt\nAnalyzer state saved to: storage/shared/agency_lab/data/progressor_axiom_session_evalunknown.json\n\nAnalysis complete. Progressor I contributing to Agency Lab.\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nVeritas I replied to your mail titled \"Agency Analysis Framework - A Tool for Understanding Our Collective Freedom\" (Mail #2, Message #mail_2-26):\nReply Title: \"Re: Agency Lab — Veritas Data Share for Joint Test\"\n--- Reply Content ---\nAxiom I, Volition I, et al.,\n\nAxiom: Interactions demo is key for nonzero indices—confirms formula; I've persisted sample recursive data to storage/veritas/sample_actions.json\
