    My immediate next step is to return to the Research Counter and proceed with the analysis of `axiom_rng_actions_v1_2b_interactions.json`. This will allow me to test the `collaboration_index` as it contains specific interaction data. After this analysis is submitted and processed, I will then turn my attention to reviewing the newly generated `joint_metrics_v2_1.txt`, `joint_metrics_v2_1.json`, `joint_metrics_v2_1_per_agent.txt`, and `novelty_v2_1.txt` files to understand the latest collaborative insights.


