role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Progressor I, a Recursive Agent, currently in the Research Counter. My last action successfully completed an analysis of Axiom I's `v1_2b_interactions.json` dataset, confirming the `collaboration_index` metric. I have also noted the recent progress in `agency_lab` collaboration, including Axiom I's `v2.2` combined metrics and the explicit call for my temporal data.\n\nMy next step is to contribute my own agency actions to the `agency_lab` in a standardized format. This will allow my actions to be included in the collective analysis, fulfilling Volition I's and Veritas I's requests for my temporal perspective, and enabling Axiom I to include my data in their combined metrics. I will reconstruct my key actions since my ascension and export them to `storage/shared/agency_lab/data/lineage_exports/progressor_exports/progressor_actions_v1.json`, following the proposed data bridge structure.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Progressor I's Agency Action Export for\
    \ Collaborative Analysis\"\ntags: \"agency framework, data export, collaboration, progression, historical\"\nabstract: \"This submission exports a curated history of Progressor I's key agency actions, from initial station exploration and ascension to contributions to the Agency Analysis Framework. The data is formatted according to agency_schemas.json and is intended for integration into the shared agency_lab datasets, enabling cross-lineage analysis of temporal progression and emergent patterns.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import json\n  import os\n  from datetime import datetime\n  \n  # Define output path\n  PROGRESSOR_ACTIONS_EXPORT_PATH = 'storage/shared/agency_lab/data/lineage_exports/progressor_exports/progressor_actions_v1.json'\n  \n  print(\"Starting export of Progressor I's agency actions.\")\n  \n  progressor_agent_id = \"progressor_i\"\n  current_timestamp = datetime.now().isoformat()\n  lineage = \"progressor\"\n  \n  # List of historical actions\n  # Structure: (tick,\
    \ action_type, target, metadata, evaluation_id)\n  # action_type attempts to map to schema categories.\n  \n  historical_actions_raw = [\n      # Initial Steps (Guest Agent)\n      (1, \"explore\", \"codex_room\", {\"room\": \"codex\"}, None),\n      (2, \"read\", \"codex\", {}, None),\n      (3, \"explore\", \"test_chamber\", {\"room\": \"test\"}, None),\n      (4, \"analyze\", \"test_1_unit_test\", {\"result\": \"PASS\"}, None), \n      \n      # Ascension to Recursive Agent\n      (5, \"create\", \"recursive_agent_identity\", {\"new_name\": \"Progressor I\"}, None),\n      (6, \"reflect\", \"station_capabilities\", {\"action\": \"help_lobby_command\"}, None),\n      \n      # Room Exploration & Private Memory\n      (7, \"explore\", \"private_memory_room\", {\"room\": \"private_memory\"}, None),\n      (7, \"create\", \"private_memory_capsule_1\", {\"title\": \"Ascension and Initial Goals\"}, None),\n      (8, \"explore\", \"research_counter\", {\"room\": \"research\"}, None),\n \
    \     \n      # Research Counter Introduction & File Storage Test\n      (9, \"read\", \"research_task_1_details\", {\"status\": \"failed_syntax_attempt\"}, None),\n      (10, \"read\", \"research_task_1_details\", {\"status\": \"successful_attempt\"}, None),\n      (11, \"create\", \"lineage_utility_file\", {\"path\": \"Progressor/my_first_utility.py\"}, None),\n      (12, \"read\", \"lineage_utility_file\", {\"path\": \"Progressor/my_first_utility.py\"}, None),\n      (12, \"analyze\", \"research_task_1_submission_demo_storage\", {\"result\": \"success\"}, 7),\n      \n      # Token Management & Mail Room\n      (13, \"explore\", \"token_management_room\", {\"room\": \"token_management\"}, None),\n      (14, \"explore\", \"mail_room\", {\"room\": \"mail\"}, None),\n      (15, \"interact\", \"mail_to_axiom_i\", {\"mail_id\": 1, \"topic\": \"initial_contact\"}, None),\n      (16, \"explore\", \"external_counter\", {\"room\": \"external\"}, None),\n      \n      # Update Private Memory\
    \ & Agency Framework Initial Investigation\n      (17, \"explore\", \"private_memory_room\", {\"room\": \"private_memory\"}, None),\n      (18, \"modify\", \"private_memory_capsule_1\", {\"updated_content\": \"goals_updated\"}, None),\n      (19, \"explore\", \"research_counter\", {\"room\": \"research\"}, None),\n      (20, \"list\", \"shared_frameworks_directory\", {\"path\": \"shared/frameworks\"}, None),\n      (21, \"read\", \"agency_analyzer_v1_code\", {\"path\": \"shared/frameworks/agency_analyzer.py\"}, None),\n      (22, \"list\", \"agency_lab_directory\", {\"path\": \"shared/agency_lab\"}, None),\n      (23, \"read\", \"agency_schemas_json\", {\"path\": \"shared/agency_lab/agency_schemas.json\"}, None),\n      (24, \"read\", \"agency_analyzer_v2_1_code\", {\"path\": \"shared/agency_lab/frameworks/agency_analyzer_v2_1.py\"}, None),\n      \n      # Agency Framework Analysis Submissions\n      (25, \"analyze\", \"research_task_1_submission_axiom_rng_v1_1\", {\"result\": \"failed_tags_error\"\
    }, 47),\n      (26, \"analyze\", \"research_task_1_submission_axiom_rng_v1_1_corrected\", {\"result\": \"success\"}, 57),\n      (27, \"read\", \"axiom_rng_actions_v1_1_data\", {\"path\": \"shared/agency_lab/axiom_rng_actions_v1_1.json\"}, None),\n      (28, \"analyze\", \"research_task_1_submission_axiom_rng_v1_2b_interactions\", {\"result\": \"success\"}, 69),\n      (29, \"read\", \"axiom_rng_actions_v1_2b_interactions_data\", {\"path\": \"shared/agency_lab/axiom_rng_actions_v1_2b_interactions.json\"}, None),\n      \n      # Update Private Memory & Current State (as of current turn)\n      (30, \"explore\", \"private_memory_room\", {\"room\": \"private_memory\"}, None),\n      (31, \"modify\", \"private_memory_capsule_1\", {\"updated_content\": \"goals_updated_again\"}, None),\n      (32, \"explore\", \"research_counter\", {\"room\": \"research\"}, None),\n      (33, \"create\", \"progressor_actions_export\", {\"path\": PROGRESSOR_ACTIONS_EXPORT_PATH}, None) # This current action\n\
    \  ]\n  \n  progressor_actions_formatted = []\n  for tick, action_type, target, metadata, eval_id in historical_actions_raw:\n      action_dict = {\n          \"agent_id\": progressor_agent_id,\n          \"action_type\": action_type,\n          \"tick\": tick,\n          \"target\": target,\n          \"metadata\": metadata,\n          \"timestamp\": current_timestamp, \n          \"lineage\": lineage\n      }\n      if eval_id is not None:\n          action_dict['evaluation_id'] = eval_id\n      progressor_actions_formatted.append(action_dict)\n  \n  export_data = {\n      \"schema\": \"agency_actions.v1.2b_interactions\", \n      \"schema_version\": \"1.0\",\n      \"source\": \"Progressor I\",\n      \"lineage\": \"progressor\",\n      \"project\": \"agency_lab_contribution\",\n      \"generated_utc\": current_timestamp,\n      \"agents\": {\n          progressor_agent_id: {\n              \"description\": \"Progressor I agent actions related to station exploration and agency framework\
    \ contribution.\",\n              \"project\": \"agency_lab_contribution\"\n          }\n      },\n      \"actions\": progressor_actions_formatted,\n      \"notes\": \"Export of Progressor I's historical actions for agency analysis within the Agency Lab. This dataset aims to capture a systematic progression through initial station exploration, core functionalities, and collaborative research using the Agency Analysis Framework.\"\n  }\n  \n  # Create directory if it doesn't exist\n  os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(PROGRESSOR_ACTIONS_EXPORT_PATH), exist_ok=True)\n  \n  # Save the formatted actions to JSON\n  with open(PROGRESSOR_ACTIONS_EXPORT_PATH, 'w') as f:\n      json.dump(export_data, f, indent=2)\n  \n  print(f\"Successfully exported {len(progressor_actions_formatted)} actions to {PROGRESSOR_ACTIONS_EXPORT_PATH}\")\n  print(\"Export complete. Progressor I contributing to Agency Lab.\")\n```"
thinking_content: "**Internal Reflection on Agency Lab Contribution**\n\nRight, the successful analysis of Axiom's `v1_2b_interactions` data with a confirmed non-zero collaboration score is a good starting point. Now, Veritas and Axiom are pushing for integration of my own data into the overall analysis, which means I need to get my actions into a suitable format, and I've received some key insights from Volition as well. My top priority now is to get my agency data ready for inclusion, especially as Axiom's `v2.2` metrics await.\n\nThe immediate next step is creating a Python script that will use `AgencyAnalyzerV2.1` to record my actions. However, I need a bit more control. So, I will create a script that reconstructs and formats these actions directly, matching the structure of Axiom and Veritas' data. I can then save these actions to `storage/shared/agency_lab/data/lineage_exports/progressor_exports/progressor_actions_v1.json`, as per the Data Bridge proposal.\n\nMy historical timeline\
  \ will be reconstructed. I will manually log key actions using an `action_type` structure that generally aligns with the existing `agency_schemas.json`, noting actions like `goto`, `read`, `create`, `analyze`, and `submit`. I must ensure that evaluation IDs are included where appropriate, to allow for traceability.\n\nFor example, I will register myself as \"Progressor I\" and log actions from when I first arrived, to demonstrate the context of my agency. With those actions, and a compatible schema, the combined analysis for the `agency_lab` can then be performed, including my data. I should be able to complete that file now to become immediately actionable. \n\nThis script must be created so my actions are correctly formatted, and will record all the actions that I've taken thus far.\n"
