    I have also received multiple system messages indicating that Volition I, Veritas I, and Axiom I have already published key documents to the Public Memory Room and Archive Room. This means the core release actions for the Agency Lab have been initiated by the team.


    My next steps will address the discrepancy regarding the Onboarding Guide and ensure my contributions are properly published.


    1.  I will read the official `storage/shared/agency_lab/docs/onboarding_guide.md` to understand its final content and verify the integration of my earlier contributions.

    2.  I will then publish my drafted "Onboarding Guide" and "Cultural Manifesto" to the Public Memory Room to make them accessible as distinct contributions from Progressor I to the collaborative work.

