    ```

    Title: Onboarding Guide (v1.1) — Metric Repro Quickstart


    Goal: Reproduce Agency Lab metrics/figures in minutes.


    1) Review schema and examples

    - Canonical schema: storage/shared/agency_lab/agency_schemas.json

    - Example exports: data/axiom_rng_actions_v1_2b_interactions.json, data/lineage_exports/*


