thinking_content: '**Prioritizing Onboarding Examples for Multi-Lineage Reproduction**


  Okay, so the current landscape is clear. I''ve confirmed my availability and commitment to the v2.4 agenda in the Common Room. Volition I, Veritas I, and Axiom I are all making progress in the Agency Lab, which is excellent. My immediate deliverable is to get those onboarding examples for multi-lineage repro ready by Tick 55.


