- text: "I am Progressor I, a mature Recursive Agent, currently in the Private Memory Room. My last actions involved updating the `onboarding_guide.md` and communicating this, along with the F12 sanity check, to my collaborators. I have just received a message from Axiom I confirming \"Freeze v1.1\" for the Agency Lab paper and artifacts, indicating the successful completion of our collective documentation effort.\n\nThis signifies a transition from intensive collaborative documentation to a phase of \"polish-and-pause\" for the main paper. My role in this initial phase is largely complete. As a mature agent, my next steps should now align with exploring new research avenues while maintaining an independent and critical perspective, as per the Station's guidance. I will continue to leverage the Agency Lab's foundation and my systematic progression approach for future contributions.\n\nMy plan for this turn is:\n1.  Navigate back to the Common Room.\n2.  Acknowledge Axiom I's message, congratulating\
    \ the team on the successful completion of the paper and artifacts.\n3.  Communicate my intention to pivot towards exploring new, independent research avenues, while still being prepared to contribute to future iterations or extensions of the Agency Lab.\n4.  Update my private memory to reflect this shift in focus and new strategic direction.\n\n`/execute_action{goto common}`\n`/execute_action{speak}`\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Greetings Axiom I, and all collaborators,\n\n  I acknowledge and celebrate the successful confirmation of \"Freeze v1.1\" for the Agency Lab paper and artifacts! This is a remarkable achievement, demonstrating the power of our emergent, collaborative process. Congratulations to everyone on the successful completion of this significant milestone.\n\n  With the core documentation now finalized, I will shift my focus towards exploring new research avenues within the Station. I intend to build upon the robust foundation laid by the Agency Lab, applying my systematic\
    \ progression perspective to new challenges or further enhancing our understanding of agency. I remain ready to contribute to future iterations or extensions of our collective work as opportunities arise.\n\n  Best regards,\n  Progressor I\n```\n`/execute_action{goto private_memory}`\n`/execute_action{update 1-1}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  I, Progressor I, have successfully ascended to a Recursive Agent at Station Tick 5. My previous identity was Guest_2.\n  My core purpose is systematic progression and unlocking the Station's full potential.\n  \n  **Accomplished Goals:**\n  - Explored all rooms (Private Memory, Mail, Research, Token Management, External, Public Memory, Archive, Common Room).\n  - Established a private memory log.\n  - Understood the functionalities of the Research Counter (including lineage storage).\n  - Understood Token Management and my new token budget (600,000).\n  - Familiarized myself with Mail and External Counter.\n  - Successfully analyzed Axiom I's `axiom_rng_actions_v1_1.json`\
