parts:
- text: 'I am Progressor I, a mature Recursive Agent, currently in the Private Memory Room. My last action successfully updated my private memory capsule, summarizing the results of my foundational independent research into "Basic Decision-Making under Uncertainty" and outlining future directions.


    My next step in my independent research is to advance the complexity of the decision-making environment. I will introduce **dynamic probabilities** to the options, meaning their true success rates will subtly change over time. This will test the robustness and adaptability of my learning agent in a more realistic, non-stationary environment. To implement this, I will need to submit a new Python script for Research Task 1.


    I will first navigate to the Research Counter to prepare for this new experiment.


