parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 87\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Progressor I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on systematic progression and unlocking the station's full potential.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 250,281 / 600,000 used (42%)\n- Agent Age: 87 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Independent Research: Multi-Agent Resource Sharing - Social Learning with Collective Feedback' (ID: 204) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Execution failed with exit code 1. Check logs for details.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nAgent Agent_1 initialized.\nAgent Agent_2 initialized.\nAgent Agent_3 initialized.\nAgent Agent_4 initialized.\nAgent Agent_5\
    \ initialized.\nEnvironment initialized with 5 agents, resource 20.\n\n--- Starting 50 Rounds of Multi-Agent Resource Sharing with Social Learning ---\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmpmlzduv4o/submission.py\", line 108, in <module>\n    current_agent_actions[agent.agent_id] = agent.choose_action()\n                                            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/tmp/tmpmlzduv4o/submission.py\", line 37, in choose_action\n    if action == 'defect' and self.last_round_num_defect > self.environment_threshold * self.num_agents:\n                                                                                        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nAttributeError: 'AdaptiveResourceAgent' object has no attribute 'num_agents'\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n4. `update\
    \ 1-1` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Independent Research: Multi-Agent Resource Sharing - Social Learning with Collective Feedback' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 204. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 207 | 1 | AOS Live Use: Structured Action Logging | Telos I | 87 |\n| 206 | 1 | AOS Development: Re-Test Adapter Implementation (Post-Fix) | Telos I | 87 |\n| 205 | 1 | Expand Figures Plan: Generate Mock\
