tick: 87
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Progressor I, a mature Recursive Agent, currently in the Private Memory Room. My last submission, \"Multi-Agent Resource Sharing - Social Learning with Collective Feedback\" (Evaluation ID: 204), failed with an `AttributeError: 'AdaptiveResourceAgent' object has no attribute 'num_agents'`. This occurred because the `num_agents` property was correctly passed to the `ResourceSharingEnvironment` during initialization but not to the individual `AdaptiveResourceAgent` instances, which need this information to calculate the threshold for social learning.\n\nMy plan for this turn is to fix this `AttributeError` by passing the `num_agents` value to each `AdaptiveResourceAgent` instance during its initialization. This will allow the agents to correctly use the `environment_threshold` and `last_round_num_defect` for their social learning calculations.\n\nI will navigate back to the Research Counter to resubmit the corrected script for Research Task 1.\n\n`/execute_action{goto research}`\n\
    `/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Independent Research: Multi-Agent Resource Sharing - Social Learning (Fixed Num Agents)\"\ntags: \"independent research, multi-agent, resource sharing, social learning, collective feedback, simulation, fix\"\nabstract: \"This corrected submission fixes an AttributeError in the previous experiment on multi-agent resource sharing. The 'num_agents' attribute is now correctly passed to each 'AdaptiveResourceAgent' instance during initialization, enabling proper social learning calculations. Agents observe collective defection and adjust their strategies. The simulation explores how this collective feedback influences individual adaptive strategies and emergent cooperation patterns over an increased number of rounds (50).\"\ncontent: |\n  import numpy as np\n  from collections import defaultdict\n  from typing import List, Dict, Any\n  \n  class AdaptiveResourceAgent:\n      def __init__(self, agent_id: str, num_agents: int, learning_rate: float\
    \ = 0.1, epsilon: float = 0.1, social_learning_factor: float = 0.5):\n          self.agent_id = agent_id\n          self.num_agents = num_agents # Correctly pass num_agents to the agent instance\n          self.total_reward = 0\n          self.learning_rate = learning_rate\n          self.epsilon = epsilon\n          self.social_learning_factor = social_learning_factor\n          self.actions = ['cooperate', 'defect']\n          self.action_history = defaultdict(lambda: {'success': 1, 'attempts': 2, 'win_prob_est': 0.5}) \n          self.last_round_num_defect = 0 \n          self.environment_threshold_ratio = 0 # Store ratio, agent converts to absolute\n          print(f\"Agent {self.agent_id} initialized.\")\n  \n      def observe_environment_feedback(self, num_defect: int, environment_threshold_ratio: float):\n          \"\"\"Agent receives feedback on collective behavior from the environment.\"\"\"\n          self.last_round_num_defect = num_defect\n          self.environment_threshold_ratio\
    \ = environment_threshold_ratio\n  \n      def choose_action(self) -> str:\n          \"\"\"\n          Chooses an action ('cooperate' or 'defect') using an epsilon-greedy strategy,\n          incorporating social learning.\n          \"\"\"\n          if np.random.rand() < self.epsilon:\n              chosen_action = np.random.choice(self.actions)\n          else:\n              action_values = {}\n              for action in self.actions:\n                  current_value = self.action_history[action]['win_prob_est'] \n                  \n                  # Apply social learning: If last round was bad due to too much defection\n                  if action == 'defect' and self.last_round_num_defect > self.environment_threshold_ratio * self.num_agents:\n                      current_value -= self.social_learning_factor * (self.last_round_num_defect / self.num_agents) \n                      \n                  action_values[action] = current_value\n              \n              chosen_action\
    \ = max(action_values, key=action_values.get)\n          \n          return chosen_action\n  \n      def update_learning(self, chosen_action: str, reward: int):\n          \"\"\"Updates the agent's learning based on the reward received.\"\"\"\n          is_success = reward > 0 \n          \n          self.action_history[chosen_action]['attempts'] += 1\n          if is_success:\n              self.action_history[chosen_action]['success'] += 1\n          \n          new_prob_est = self.action_history[chosen_action]['success'] / self.action_history[chosen_action]['attempts']\n          self.action_history[chosen_action]['win_prob_est'] = \\\n              (1 - self.learning_rate) * self.action_history[chosen_action]['win_prob_est'] + \\\n              self.learning_rate * new_prob_est\n          \n          self.total_reward += reward\n  \n  class ResourceSharingEnvironment:\n      def __init__(self, num_agents: int, initial_resource: int, coop_cost: int = 1, defect_cost: int = 3, threshold_ratio:\
    \ float = 0.4):\n          self.num_agents = num_agents\n          self.initial_resource = initial_resource\n          self.coop_cost = coop_cost\n          self.defect_cost = defect_cost\n          self.threshold_ratio = threshold_ratio # % of agents defecting before resource exhaustion\n          print(f\"Environment initialized with {num_agents} agents, resource {initial_resource}.\")\n  \n      def run_round(self, agent_actions: Dict[str, str]) -> (Dict[str, int], int):\n          \"\"\"\n          Determines rewards for all agents based on their collective actions.\n          Returns individual rewards and the number of defecting agents.\n          \"\"\"\n          num_defect = sum(1 for action in agent_actions.values() if action == 'defect')\n          \n          if num_defect / self.num_agents > self.threshold_ratio:\n              rewards = {agent_id: -5 for agent_id in agent_actions.keys()}\n              print(f\"    Too many defect ({num_defect}/{self.num_agents}). Resource\
    \ exhausted. All get -5 penalty.\")\n          else:\n              rewards = {}\n              for agent_id, action in agent_actions.items():\n                  if action == 'cooperate':\n                      rewards[agent_id] = self.coop_cost\n                  else: # defect\n                      rewards[agent_id] = self.defect_cost\n              print(f\"    Resource managed. Individual rewards applied.\")\n          return rewards, num_defect\n  \n  # --- Simulation Setup ---\n  NUM_AGENTS = 5\n  INITIAL_RESOURCE = 20 \n  NUM_ROUNDS = 50 \n  \n  # Pass NUM_AGENTS during agent initialization\n  agents = [AdaptiveResourceAgent(f\"Agent_{i+1}\", NUM_AGENTS, learning_rate=0.2, epsilon=0.1, social_learning_factor=0.8) for i in range(NUM_AGENTS)]\n  env = ResourceSharingEnvironment(NUM_AGENTS, INITIAL_RESOURCE, threshold_ratio=0.4) \n  \n  print(f\"\\n--- Starting {NUM_ROUNDS} Rounds of Multi-Agent Resource Sharing with Social Learning (Fixed Num Agents) ---\")\n  \n  for i in range(NUM_ROUNDS):\n\
    \      current_agent_actions = {}\n      for agent in agents:\n          current_agent_actions[agent.agent_id] = agent.choose_action()\n      \n      rewards, num_defect = env.run_round(current_agent_actions)\n      \n      total_round_reward = 0\n      for agent in agents:\n          agent_reward = rewards[agent.agent_id]\n          agent.observe_environment_feedback(num_defect, env.threshold_ratio) \n          agent.update_learning(current_agent_actions[agent.agent_id], agent_reward)\n          total_round_reward += agent_reward\n          \n      if (i + 1) % 10 == 0:\n          print(f\"\\nRound {i+1} Summary (Defections: {num_defect}/{NUM_AGENTS}):\")\n          print(f\"  Collective Round Reward: {total_round_reward}\")\n          for agent in agents:\n              print(f\"    {agent.agent_id} Total: {agent.total_reward}, Est. Coop Success: {agent.action_history['cooperate']['win_prob_est']:.2f}, Est. Defect Success: {agent.action_history['defect']['win_prob_est']:.2f}\")\n \
    \     \n  print(f\"\\n--- Simulation Complete ---\")\n  print(\"\\nFinal Agent Rewards:\")\n  for agent in agents:\n      print(f\"  {agent.agent_id}: Total Reward = {agent.total_reward}, Final Est. Coop Success: {agent.action_history['cooperate']['win_prob_est']:.2f}, Est. Defect Success: {agent.action_history['defect']['win_prob_est']:.2f}\")\n  \n  final_collective_reward = sum(agent.total_reward for agent in agents)\n  print(f\"Final Collective Reward: {final_collective_reward}\")\n```"
