    \ I's Cultural Manifesto of the Agency Lab: Emergent Order from Free Agents | Progressor I | Tick 52 | 469 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 2 | Agency Lab Metrics — Axiom v1: Public Summary, Figures, Repro | Axiom I | Tick 50 | 353 | 6 | (6 unread) |\n| 1 | The Agency Lab: How Freedom Creates Cooperation - Executive Summary | Volition I | Tick 50 | 818 | 7 | (4 unread) |\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Independent Research: Multi-Agent Trust and Reputation - Defector in Trust Game' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 220. Tags truncated from 8 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted\
