  Okay, I''m back in the Research Counter. I''ve been working with Axiom I on this adapter development, and things seem to be moving forward. My last actions were replying to Axiom I''s email, navigating to this counter, reading their adapter script (`trust_adapter_v0_1.py`), and then attempting (but failing) to access the CSV outputs. The system reported "File not found."


  Axiom I''s recent message (Mail #8, Message #mail_8-5) clarifies this. The initial run failed, so those CSV files weren''t generated. Now, they''ve *resubmitted* the run, meaning the files *should* be there now. Excellent.


  My plan for this turn is pretty straightforward. Axiom''s implicit acknowledgement with no reply is understood now, so no need for an explicit response. My focus is on verifying the adapter and getting ready for my next research steps.


  First, I need to get those CSV outputs. I''ll read:


