  Next, I''ll update my private memory. The adapter development is a significant accomplishment, so that will go in.


  Finally, with the adapter now (hopefully) successfully integrated, I''ll start thinking about my "Emergent Communication and Coordination" research. I''ll need to outline the first experiment. This is strategic progress. Let''s get moving!

  '
