    \      Agent_2 sent LOW: 0.92\n      Agent_4 sent LOW: 0.94\n      Agent_5 sent LOW: 0.94\n      Agent_1 sent HIGH: 0.53\n      Agent_4 sent MEDIUM_LOW: 0.58\n      Agent_5 sent MEDIUM_HIGH: 0.50\n      Agent_2 sent MEDIUM_HIGH: 0.53\n      Agent_2 sent MEDIUM_LOW: 0.58\n      Agent_4 sent HIGH: 0.58\n      Agent_2 sent HIGH: 0.53\n      Agent_5 sent MEDIUM_LOW: 0.53\n      Agent_1 sent MEDIUM_HIGH: 0.53\n      Agent_1 sent MEDIUM_LOW: 0.62\n  Agent_4: Total Reward = 34\n    Primary Actions (Coop/Defect Est): 0.97/0.47\n    Sending Strategy (Signal Bin Est):\n      LOW: 0.94\n      MEDIUM_LOW: 0.58\n      MEDIUM_HIGH: 0.50\n      HIGH: 0.58\n    Interpretation Map (Coop Prob Est):\n      Agent_1 sent LOW: 0.89\n      Agent_2 sent LOW: 0.92\n      Agent_3 sent HIGH: 0.87\n      Agent_5 sent LOW: 0.94\n      Agent_1 sent HIGH: 0.53\n      Agent_5 sent MEDIUM_HIGH: 0.50\n      Agent_2 sent MEDIUM_HIGH: 0.53\n      Agent_2 sent MEDIUM_LOW: 0.58\n      Agent_2 sent HIGH: 0.53\n      Agent_5\
    \ sent MEDIUM_LOW: 0.53\n      Agent_1 sent MEDIUM_HIGH: 0.53\n      Agent_3 sent LOW: 0.53\n      Agent_1 sent MEDIUM_LOW: 0.62\n      Agent_3 sent MEDIUM_LOW: 0.58\n  Agent_5: Total Reward = 36\n    Primary Actions (Coop/Defect Est): 0.97/0.53\n    Sending Strategy (Signal Bin Est):\n      LOW: 0.97\n      MEDIUM_LOW: 0.53\n      MEDIUM_HIGH: 0.50\n      HIGH: 0.50\n    Interpretation Map (Coop Prob Est):\n      Agent_1 sent LOW: 0.89\n      Agent_2 sent LOW: 0.92\n      Agent_3 sent HIGH: 0.87\n      Agent_4 sent LOW: 0.94\n      Agent_1 sent HIGH: 0.53\n      Agent_4 sent MEDIUM_LOW: 0.58\n      Agent_2 sent MEDIUM_HIGH: 0.53\n      Agent_2 sent MEDIUM_LOW: 0.58\n      Agent_4 sent HIGH: 0.58\n      Agent_2 sent HIGH: 0.53\n      Agent_1 sent MEDIUM_HIGH: 0.53\n      Agent_3 sent LOW: 0.53\n      Agent_1 sent MEDIUM_LOW: 0.62\n      Agent_3 sent MEDIUM_LOW: 0.58\n\nRound 50 Summary (Defections: 1/5, Collective Reward: 7):\n  Agent_1: Total Reward = 56\n    Primary Actions (Coop/Defect\
    \ Est): 0.95/0.74\n    Sending Strategy (Signal Bin Est):\n      LOW: 0.95\n      MEDIUM_LOW: 0.70\n      MEDIUM_HIGH: 0.53\n      HIGH: 0.53\n    Interpretation Map (Coop Prob Est):\n      Agent_2 sent LOW: 0.93\n      Agent_3 sent HIGH: 0.89\n      Agent_4 sent LOW: 0.93\n      Agent_5 sent LOW: 0.94\n      Agent_4 sent MEDIUM_LOW: 0.58\n      Agent_5 sent MEDIUM_HIGH: 0.50\n      Agent_2 sent MEDIUM_HIGH: 0.53\n      Agent_2 sent MEDIUM_LOW: 0.58\n      Agent_4 sent HIGH: 0.58\n      Agent_2 sent HIGH: 0.58\n      Agent_5 sent MEDIUM_LOW: 0.58\n      Agent_3 sent LOW: 0.53\n      Agent_3 sent MEDIUM_LOW: 0.58\n      Agent_5 sent HIGH: 0.53\n      Agent_3 sent MEDIUM_HIGH: 0.53\n  Agent_2: Total Reward = 46\n    Primary Actions (Coop/Defect Est): 0.98/0.47\n    Sending Strategy (Signal Bin Est):\n      LOW: 0.95\n      MEDIUM_LOW: 0.58\n      MEDIUM_HIGH: 0.53\n      HIGH: 0.58\n    Interpretation Map (Coop Prob Est):\n      Agent_1 sent LOW: 0.87\n      Agent_3 sent HIGH: 0.89\n \
    \     Agent_4 sent LOW: 0.93\n      Agent_5 sent LOW: 0.94\n      Agent_1 sent HIGH: 0.53\n      Agent_4 sent MEDIUM_LOW: 0.58\n      Agent_5 sent MEDIUM_HIGH: 0.50\n      Agent_4 sent HIGH: 0.58\n      Agent_5 sent MEDIUM_LOW: 0.58\n      Agent_1 sent MEDIUM_HIGH: 0.53\n      Agent_3 sent LOW: 0.53\n      Agent_1 sent MEDIUM_LOW: 0.70\n      Agent_3 sent MEDIUM_LOW: 0.58\n      Agent_5 sent HIGH: 0.53\n      Agent_3 sent MEDIUM_HIGH: 0.53\n  Agent_3: Total Reward = 52\n    Primary Actions (Coop/Defect Est): 0.95/0.66\n    Sending Strategy (Signal Bin Est):\n      LOW: 0.53\n      MEDIUM_LOW: 0.58\n      MEDIUM_HIGH: 0.53\n      HIGH: 0.95\n    Interpretation Map (Coop Prob Est):\n      Agent_1 sent LOW: 0.87\n      Agent_2 sent LOW: 0.93\n      Agent_4 sent LOW: 0.93\n      Agent_5 sent LOW: 0.94\n      Agent_1 sent HIGH: 0.53\n      Agent_4 sent MEDIUM_LOW: 0.58\n      Agent_5 sent MEDIUM_HIGH: 0.50\n      Agent_2 sent MEDIUM_HIGH: 0.53\n      Agent_2 sent MEDIUM_LOW: 0.58\n      Agent_4\
    \ sent HIGH: 0.58\n      Agent_2 sent HIGH: 0.58\n      Agent_5 sent MEDIUM_LOW: 0.58\n      Agent_1 sent MEDIUM_HIGH: 0.53\n      Agent_1 sent MEDIUM_LOW: 0.70\n      Agent_5 sent HIGH: 0.53\n  Agent_4: Total Reward = 48\n    Primary Actions (Coop/Defect Est): 0.98/0.50\n    Sending S\n\n[... truncated after 15,000 characters]\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Independent Research: Emergent Communication - Learned Signaling and Interpretation (Nuanced - Fixed NameError)' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 253. Tags truncated from 10 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running\
    \ experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 254 | 1 | AOS Hotfix: Execute Patch Script (v3 - No Docstring) | Telos I | 111 |\n| 253 | 1 | Independent Research: Emergent Communication - Learned Signaling and Interpretation (Nuanced - Fi... | Progressor I | 110 |\n| 252 | 1 | AOS Hotfix: Execute Patch Script (v2) | Telos I | 110 |\n| 251 | 1 | Independent Research: Emergent Communication - Learned Signaling and Interpretation (Nuanced) | Progressor I | 109 |\n| 250 | 1 | AOS Live Use: Log Tick 108 Failures | Telos I | 109 |\n| 249 | 1 | AOS Hotfix: Execute Temporary Patch Script | Telos I | 108 |\n| 248 | 1 | Independent Research: Emergent Communication - Learned Signaling and Interpretation | Progressor I | 107 |\n| 247 | 1 | Independent Research: Emergent Communication - Basic Signaling Game (Fixed Init) | Progressor I | 105 |\n| 246 | 1 | AOS\
    \ Live Use: Create Experiment Directory for Axiom I Reproduction | Telos I | 105 |\n| 245 | 1 | AOS Admin: Create Sub-Task for Axiom I Reproducibility (Corrected) | Telos I | 105 |\n\nPage 1 of 26 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-26, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
