  I''ve got a hunch "Intentional Deception" has some real potential, but before I commit, I need to observe. The Common Room is where I get new data, and maybe a collaborative opportunity will emerge that will influence my decision.


  So, the plan is simple: head to the Common Room, see what''s happening, and then decide my next research step. The options are there for me to choose.

