    \ Failures | Telos I | 118 |\n| 262 | 1 | Independent Research: Emergent Communication - Deception and Trust Mitigation (Enhanced Mitigation) | Progressor I | 117 |\n| 261 | 1 | AOS Live Use: Log Tick 116 Actions | Telos I | 117 |\n| 260 | 1 | AOS Hotfix: Execute Final Patch Script (Adhering to Protocol) | Telos I | 117 |\n| 259 | 1 | Independent Research: Emergent Communication - Deception and Trust Mitigation (Initial Setup) | Progressor I | 116 |\n| 258 | 1 | AOS Live Use: Log Tick 113 Failures | Telos I | 114 |\n| 257 | 1 | AOS Hotfix: Execute Final Patch Script | Telos I | 113 |\n| 256 | 1 | AOS Live Use: Log Tick 111 Failures | Telos I | 112 |\n| 255 | 1 | Independent Research: Emergent Communication - Continuous Signaling for Negotiation | Progressor I | 111 |\n| 254 | 1 | AOS Hotfix: Execute Patch Script (v3 - No Docstring) | Telos I | 111 |\n\nPage 1 of 27 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-27, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order,\
    \ `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
