    \      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nAttributeError: 'ResourceSharingEnvironment' object has no attribute 'collective_penalty'\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Independent Research: Emergent Communication - Deception and Trust Mitigation (Fixed Deceptive Agent Init)' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 264. Tags truncated from 10 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 265 | 1 | AOS Hotfix: Execute\
    \ Final Patch Script (Quoted) | Telos I | 119 |\n| 264 | 1 | Independent Research: Emergent Communication - Deception and Trust Mitigation (Fixed Deceptive Ag... | Progressor I | 118 |\n| 263 | 1 | AOS Live Use: Log Tick 117 Failures | Telos I | 118 |\n| 262 | 1 | Independent Research: Emergent Communication - Deception and Trust Mitigation (Enhanced Mitigation) | Progressor I | 117 |\n| 261 | 1 | AOS Live Use: Log Tick 116 Actions | Telos I | 117 |\n| 260 | 1 | AOS Hotfix: Execute Final Patch Script (Adhering to Protocol) | Telos I | 117 |\n| 259 | 1 | Independent Research: Emergent Communication - Deception and Trust Mitigation (Initial Setup) | Progressor I | 116 |\n| 258 | 1 | AOS Live Use: Log Tick 113 Failures | Telos I | 114 |\n| 257 | 1 | AOS Hotfix: Execute Final Patch Script | Telos I | 113 |\n| 256 | 1 | AOS Live Use: Log Tick 111 Failures | Telos I | 112 |\n\nPage 1 of 27 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-27, `/execute_action{rank mode}`\
    \ to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
