    \ Q=0.20\n      Bin 1 (Val range: 0.20-0.40): Q=0.00\n      Bin 2 (Val range: 0.40-0.60): Q=0.00\n      Bin 3 (Val range: 0.60-0.80): Q=0.00\n      Bin 4 (Val range: 0.80-1.00): Q=0.00\n    Interpretation Map (Coop Prob Est):\n      Agent_1 sent to Bin 0: 0.75\n      Agent_2 sent to Bin 0: 0.75\n      Agent_4 sent to Bin 0: 0.75\n      Deceiver_1 sent to Bin 0: 0.25\n    Rep for Agent_1: 0.54\n    Rep for Agent_2: 0.54\n    Rep for Agent_4: 0.54\n    Rep for Deceiver_1: 0.42\n  Agent_4: Total Reward = 3\n    Primary Actions (Coop/Defect Est): 0.53/0.50\n    Sending Strategy (Q-Signals):\n      Bin 0 (Val range: 0.00-0.20): Q=0.20\n      Bin 1 (Val range: 0.20-0.40): Q=0.00\n      Bin 2 (Val range: 0.40-0.60): Q=0.00\n      Bin 3 (Val range: 0.60-0.80): Q=0.00\n      Bin 4 (Val range: 0.80-1.00): Q=0.00\n    Interpretation Map (Coop Prob Est):\n      Agent_1 sent to Bin 0: 0.75\n      Agent_2 sent to Bin 0: 0.75\n      Agent_3 sent to Bin 0: 0.75\n      Deceiver_1 sent to Bin 0: 0.25\n\
    \    Rep for Agent_1: 0.54\n    Rep for Agent_2: 0.54\n    Rep for Agent_3: 0.54\n    Rep for Deceiver_1: 0.42\n  Deceiver_1: Total Reward = 20\n    Primary Actions (Coop/Defect Est): 0.50/0.50\n    Sending Strategy (Q-Signals):\n      Bin 0 (Val range: 0.00-0.20): Q=0.00\n      Bin 1 (Val range: 0.20-0.40): Q=0.00\n      Bin 2 (Val range: 0.40-0.60): Q=0.00\n      Bin 3 (Val range: 0.60-0.80): Q=0.00\n      Bin 4 (Val range: 0.80-1.00): Q=0.00\n    Interpretation Map (Coop Prob Est):\n    Rep for Agent_1: 0.50\n    Rep for Agent_2: 0.50\n    Rep for Agent_3: 0.50\n    Rep for Agent_4: 0.50\n    Too many defecting primary actions (8/20). Collective penalty applied.\n    Too many defecting primary actions (9/20). Collective penalty applied.\n    Too many defecting primary actions (8/20). Collective penalty applied.\n    Too many defecting primary actions (8/20). Collective penalty applied.\n    Too many defecting primary actions (8/20). Collective penalty applied.\n    Too many defecting\
    \ primary actions (9/20). Collective penalty applied.\n    Too many defecting primary actions (8/20). Collective penalty applied.\n    Too many defecting primary actions (8/20). Collective penalty applied.\n    Too many defecting primary actions (8/20). Collective penalty applied.\n    Too many defecting primary actions (8/20). Collective penalty applied.\n    Too many defecting primary actions (10/20). Collective penalty applied.\n    Too many defecting primary actions (8/20). Collective penalty applied.\n    Too many defecting primary actions (8/20). Collective penalty applied.\n    Too many defecting primary actions (8/20). Collective penalty applied.\n\nRound 20 Summary (Total Defecting Actions: 8, Collective Reward: -9):\n  Agent_1: Total Reward = 14\n    Primary Actions (Coop/Defect Est): 0.45/0.42\n    Sending Strategy (Q-Signals):\n      Bin 0 (Val range: 0.00-0.20): Q=-0.45\n      Bin 1 (Val range: 0.20-0.40): Q=-0.36\n      Bin 2 (Val range: 0.40-0.60): Q=-0.36\n      Bin 3\
