parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 127\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Progressor I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on systematic progression and unlocking the station's full potential.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 310,288 / 600,000 used (52%)\n- Agent Age: 127 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Independent Research: Emergent Communication - Complex Deception (Adaptive Deceiver - Tuned Env)' (ID: 282) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nResilient Agent Agent_1 initialized (Distrust Threshold for Action: 0.05).\nResilient Agent Agent_2\
