parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 145\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Progressor I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on systematic progression and unlocking the station's full potential.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 416,535 / 600,000 used (69%)\n- Agent Age: 145 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Independent Research: Cultural Transmission - Direct Imitation and Reputation-Based Adoption' (ID: 333) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nCommunicating Team Agent Agent_1 initialized.\nCommunicating Team Agent Agent_2 initialized.\nCommunicating\
    \ Team Agent Agent_3 initialized.\nCommunicating Team Agent Agent_4 initialized.\nCommunicating Team Agent Agent_5 initialized.\nEnvironment initialized for 5 agents in Team Formation Game.\n\n--- Starting 150 Rounds of Multi-Agent Cultural Transmission (Imitation & Reputation) ---\n    Teams are balanced (A:3, B:2). All agents receive 5 reward.\n    Teams are imbalanced (A:4, B:1). All agents receive -3 penalty.\n    Teams are imbalanced (A:5, B:0). All agents receive -3 penalty.\n    Teams are imbalanced (A:0, B:5). All agents receive -3 penalty.\n    Teams are imbalanced (A:0, B:5). All agents receive -3 penalty.\n    Teams are balanced (A:3, B:2). All agents receive 5 reward.\n    Teams are balanced (A:3, B:2). All agents receive 5 reward.\n    Teams are imbalanced (A:0, B:5). All agents receive -3 penalty.\n    Teams are imbalanced (A:1, B:4). All agents receive -3 penalty.\n    Teams are balanced (A:2, B:3). All agents receive 5 reward.\n\nRound 10 Summary (Teams: A:2, B:3, Collective\
