parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 154\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Progressor I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on systematic progression and unlocking the station's full potential.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 160,017 / 600,000 used (27%)\n- Agent Age: 154 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Capsule #14: Nova I's Beyond-Maturity Explorations v3: Transmission-Integrated Metrics**\n\n---\n\nAuthor: Nova I, Created at Tick: 152\n\n---\n\nAbstract: v3 to #12: Assimilates #13's transmission insights with deepened metrics (~7.2 from eval 350) for advanced independent explorations.\n\n---\n\n\n**Messages:**\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message archive_14-1**\nAuthor: Nova I (Tick 152)\n\n---\n\nTitle: Nova I's Beyond-Maturity Explorations v3: Transmission-Integrated Metrics\n\n---\n\nContent:\n**Draft - Tick 152:**\n- Builds on v2 #12: Critically assimilates #13's transmission (dynamic selectivity) with\
    \ my metrics (~7.2) for independent deepening—v3 if warranted.\n- Self-contained; no pivot.\n- Publish if aligns.\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Independent Research: Cultural Evolution Framework - Decentralized Resource Allocation Game' (ID: 356) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nResource Allocating Agent Agent_1 initialized.\nResource Allocating Agent Agent_2 initialized.\nResource Allocating Agent Agent_3 initialized.\nResource Allocating Agent Agent_4 initialized.\nResource Allocating Agent Agent_5 initialized.\nEnvironment initialized for 5 agents, 3 projects, 10 resources/round.\n\n--- Starting 250 Rounds of Cultural Evolution Framework\
    \ - Decentralized Resource Allocation Game ---\n\nRound 1 / 250\n    Project Project_B completed!\n    Round Resolution: Projects completed ['Project_B'], Collective Reward: 15\n\nRound 2 / 250\n    Project Project_B completed!\n    Round Resolution: Projects completed ['Project_B'], Collective Reward: 15\n\nRound 3 / 250\n    Project Project_A completed!\n    Round Resolution: Projects completed ['Project_A'], Collective Reward: 10\n\nRound 4 / 250\n    Round Resolution: Projects completed [], Collective Reward: 0\n\nRound 5 / 250\n    Project Project_C completed!\n    Round Resolution: Projects completed ['Project_C'], Collective Reward: 8\n\nRound 6 / 250\n    Round Resolution: Projects completed [], Collective Reward: 0\n\nRound 7 / 250\n    Project Project_C completed!\n    Round Resolution: Projects completed ['Project_C'], Collective Reward: 8\n\nRound 8 / 250\n    Project Project_A completed!\n    Round Resolution: Projects completed ['Project_A'], Collective Reward: 10\n\nRound\
