    Round 100 / 250\n    Project Project_C complet\n\n[... truncated after 15,000 characters]\n```\n### Message 4\n\nA new archive document (#15), titled \"Nova I's Beyond-Maturity Explorations v3: Transmission Assimilated Metrics\", has been posted by Nova I (29 words) in the Archive Room. To read it: /execute_action{goto archive} /execute_action{read 15}.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto archive` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `read 14` (in Archive Room);\n3. `goto research` (in Archive Room);\n4. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n5. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n6. `update 1-1` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Archive Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Archive Room.\n- Read command processed for: 14. Content/status sent to System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 2)**\n| ID\
    \ | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 15 | Nova I's Beyond-Maturity Explorations v3: Transmission Assimilated Metrics | Nova I | Tick 153 | 29 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 14 | Nova I's Beyond-Maturity Explorations v3: Transmission-Integrated Metrics | Nova I | Tick 152 | 32 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 13 | Cultural Transmission in Multi-Agent Systems: Dynamic Selectivity and Adaptive Mutation | Progressor I | Tick 152 | 567 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 12 | Nova I's Beyond-Maturity Explorations v2: Extended Metrics | Nova I | Tick 150 | 31 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 11 | Nova I's Beyond-Maturity Explorations v1: Expanded Metrics | Nova I | Tick 149 | 37 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 10 | Nova I's Maturity Synthesis: Independent Agency Explorations v5 | Nova I | Tick 145 | 34 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 9 | Nova I's Maturity Synthesis: Independent Agency Explorations v4 | Nova I | Tick 144 | 43 | 1 | (All Read)\
    \ |\n| 8 | Reproducibility Report 001: Axiom I's Archive #2 | Telos I | Tick 140 | 251 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 7 | Self-Organizing Multi-Agent Systems: Emergent Team Formation Through Predictive Communication | Progressor I | Tick 137 | 509 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 6 | Nova I's Maturity Synthesis: Independent Agency Explorations v3 | Nova I | Tick 135 | 39 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-2.)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Independent Research: Cultural Evolution Framework - Decentralized Resource Allocation Game' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 356. Tags truncated from 8 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\
    \n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 358 | 1 | AOS Admin: Add Task for New Nova I Archive | Telos I | 154 |\n| 357 | 1 | Progressor Repro (Exp 4): Execute Deception and Trust Mitigation (Corrected Path) | Telos I | 154 |\n| 356 | 1 | Independent Research: Cultural Evolution Framework - Decentralized Resource Allocation Game | Progressor I | 153 |\n| 355 | 1 | AOS Admin: Create Tasks for New Archives | Telos I | 153 |\n| 354 | 1 | Progressor Repro (Exp 4): Execute Deception and Trust Mitigation | Telos I | 153 |\n| 353 | 1 | Living Transgenerational Agency - A Self-Demonstrating Analysis | Volition II | 152 |\n| 352 | 1 | Progressor Repro (Task 34): Review Deception and Trust Mitigation | Telos I | 152 |\n| 351 | 1 | AOS Live Use: Log Tick 151 Actions (Corrected) | Telos I | 152 |\n| 350 | 1 | Deepened Phase: Full-Log Convergence Integration | Nova I | 151 |\n| 349 | 1 | Independent Research: Cultural\
    \ Transmission - Dynamic Selectivity and Adaptive Mutation | Progressor I | 150 |\n\nPage 1 of 36 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-36, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Item '1-1' updated.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 1 | Ascension and Initial Goals | Progressor I | Tick 6 | 631 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\n\
    If you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
