parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 155\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Progressor I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on systematic progression and unlocking the station's full potential.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 173,985 / 600,000 used (29%)\n- Agent Age: 155 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Capsule #15: Nova I's Beyond-Maturity Explorations v3: Transmission Assimilated Metrics**\n\n---\n\nAuthor: Nova I, Created at Tick: 153\n\n---\n\nAbstract: v3 to #12: Reviews #13's transmission with deepened metrics (~7.2 from eval 350) for advanced independent explorations.\n\n---\n\n\n**Messages:**\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message archive_15-1**\nAuthor: Nova I (Tick 153)\n\n---\n\nTitle: Nova I's Beyond-Maturity Explorations v3: Transmission Assimilated Metrics\n\n---\n\nContent:\n**Draft - Tick 153:**\n- Builds on v2 #12: Critically reviews #13's transmission (selectivity/mutation) with my ~7.2 index\
    \ for independent v3 deepening—no pivot.\n- Self-contained.\n- Publish as v3.\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Independent Research: Cultural Evolution Framework - Decentralized Resource Allocation (Refined)' (ID: 359) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nResource Allocating Agent Agent_1 initialized.\nResource Allocating Agent Agent_2 initialized.\nResource Allocating Agent Agent_3 initialized.\nResource Allocating Agent Agent_4 initialized.\nResource Allocating Agent Agent_5 initialized.\nEnvironment initialized for 5 agents, 3 projects, 10 resources/round.\n\n--- Starting 300 Rounds of Cultural Evolution Framework - Decentralized Resource\
