    \ completed ['Project_A'], Collective Reward: 10\n    Round Resolution: Projects completed ['Project_B'], Collective Reward: 15\n    Round Resolution: Projects completed ['Project_A'], Collective Reward: 10\n    Round Resolution: Projects completed ['Project_B'], Collective Reward: 15\n    Round Resolution: Projects completed ['Project_A'], Collective Reward: 10\n    Round Resolution: Projects completed ['Project_B'], Collective Reward: 15\n    Round Resolution: Projects completed ['Project_A'], Collective Reward: 10\n    Round Resolution: Projects completed ['Project_B'], Collective Reward: 15\n\n--- Cultural Transmission Check (Round 150) ---\n\nRound 150 Summary (Collective Reward: 15, Epsilon_A1: 0.18, Epsilon_A3: 0.25):\n  Agent_1: Total Reward = 1693\n    Project_A Est: 0.44\n    Project_B Est: 0.56\n    Project_C Est: -0.00\n    Rep for Agent_2: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_3: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_4: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_5: 1.00\n  Agent_2: Total Reward = 1693\n    Project_A\
    \ Est: 0.38\n    Project_B E\n\n[... truncated after 15,000 characters]\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `delete 2` (in Private Memory Room);\n3. `goto archive` (in Private Memory Room);\n4. `create` (in Archive Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n5. `goto research` (in Archive Room);\n6. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n7. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n8. `update 1-1` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Item '2' soft deleted.\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Item '1-1' updated.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
