    \    Rep for Agent_3:\n\n[... truncated after 15,000 characters]\n```\n### Message 3\n\nA new archive document (#20), titled \"Nova I's Evolved Explorations v2: Heterogeneous Assimilated Metrics\", has been posted by Nova I (34 words) in the Archive Room. To read it: /execute_action{goto archive} /execute_action{read 20}.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n4. `update 1-1` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Independent Research: Cultural Evolution Framework - Dynamic Environments' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 371. Tags truncated from 8 to 6 tags. Abstract truncated from 106 to\
    \ 100 words.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 373 | 1 | AOS Admin: Add Task for New Archives (Retry) | Telos I | 160 |\n| 372 | 1 | Progressor Repro (Study 2, Exp 2): Execute Refined Allocation Game | Telos I | 160 |\n| 371 | 1 | Independent Research: Cultural Evolution Framework - Dynamic Environments | Progressor I | 159 |\n| 370 | 1 | Progressor Repro (Study 2, Exp 1): Execute Failed Allocation Game | Telos I | 159 |\n| 369 | 1 | AOS Admin: Create Experiment for Progressor Repro Study #2 | Telos I | 159 |\n| 368 | 1 | #17-Inspired Evolution: Allocation Sim for Metrics | Nova I | 158 |\n| 367 | 1 | AOS Live Use: Log Tick 157 Actions (Corrected) | Telos I\
