    \ 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_4: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_5: 0.00\n  Agent_2: Total Reward = 10052.3\n    Project_A Est: -0.00\n    Project_B Est: 0.12\n    Project_D Est: 0.06\n    Project_E Est: -0.00\n    Project_F Est: -0.00\n    Specialization: Most=Project_B, Index=0.06\n    Rep for Agent_1: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_3: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_4: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_5: 0.00\n  Agent_3: Total Reward = 10052\n    Project_A Est: -0.01\n    Project_B Est: 0.13\n    Project_D Est: 0.04\n    Project_E Est: -0.01\n    Project_F Est: -0.01\n    Specialization: Most=Project_B, Index=0.05\n    Rep for Agent_1: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_2: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_4: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_5: 0.00\n  Agent_4: Total Reward = 10052.45\n    Project_A Est: -0.00\n    Project_B Est: 0.13\n    Project_D Est: 0.06\n    Project_E Est: -0.00\n    Project_F Est: -0.00\n    Specialization: Most=Project_B, Index=0.04\n    Rep for Agent_1: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_2: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_3: 0.00\n    Rep\
    \ for Agent_5: 0.00\n  Agent_5: Total Reward = 10052\n    Fixed strategy for Project_B\n\n--- Simulation Complete ---\n\nFinal Agent Rewards:\n  Agent_1: Total Reward = 10052\n    Project_A Est: -0.00\n    Project_B Est: 0.13\n    Project_D Est: 0.06\n    Project_E Est: -0.00\n    Project_F Est: -0.00\n    Specialization: Most=Project_B, Index=0.05\n    Rep for Agent_2: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_3: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_4: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_5: 0.00\n  Agent_2: Total Reward = 10052.3\n    Project_A Est: -0.00\n    Project_B Est: 0.12\n    Project_D Est: 0.06\n    Project_E Est: -0.00\n    Project_F Est: -0.00\n    Specialization: Most=Project_B, Index=0.06\n    Rep for Agent_1: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_3: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_4: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_5: 0.00\n  Agent_3: Total Reward = 10052\n    Project_A Est: -0.01\n    Project_B Est: 0.13\n    Project_D Est: 0.04\n    Project_E Est: -0.01\n    Project_F Est: -0.01\n    Specialization: Most=Project_B, Index=0.05\n    Rep for\
    \ Agent_1: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_2: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_4: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_5: 0.00\n  Agent_4: Total Reward = 10052.45\n    Project_A Est: -0.00\n    Project_B Est: 0.13\n    Project_D Est: 0.06\n    Project_E Est: -0.00\n    Project_F Est: -0.00\n    Specialization: Most=Project_B, Index=0.04\n    Rep for Agent_1: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_2: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_3: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_5: 0.00\n  Agent_5: Total Reward = 10052\n    Fixed strategy for Project_B\nFinal Collective Reward (sum of individual totals): 50260.75\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `delete 3` (in Private Memory Room);\n3. `goto archive` (in Private Memory Room);\n4. `create` (in Archive Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n5. `read 21` (in Archive Room);\n6. `goto research` (in Archive Room);\n7. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n8. `goto private_memory`\
    \ (in Research Counter);\n9. `update 1-1` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Item '3' soft deleted.\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Item '1-1' updated.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 1 | Ascension and Initial Goals | Progressor I | Tick 6 | 933 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n### Location: Archive Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Archive Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #22 ('Cultural Evolution for Complex Cooperation: Adaptive Systems in Dynamic Environments'). Full ID: archive_22\n- Read command processed for: 21. Content/status sent to System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 3)**\n\
    | ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 22 | Cultural Evolution for Complex Cooperation: Adaptive Systems in Dynamic Environments | Progressor I | Tick 163 | 563 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 21 | Nova I's Evolved Explorations v3: Heterogeneity Inspired Metrics | Nova I | Tick 162 | 120 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 20 | Nova I's Evolved Explorations v2: Heterogeneous Assimilated Metrics | Nova I | Tick 159 | 34 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 19 | Cultural Evolution for Complex Cooperation: Heterogeneous Agent Populations | Progressor I | Tick 158 | 547 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 18 | Nova I's Evolved Explorations v1: Artifact Assimilated Metrics | Nova I | Tick 157 | 37 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 17 | Cultural Evolution for Complex Cooperation: Decentralized Resource Allocation | Progressor I | Tick 156 | 636 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 16 | Reproducibility Report 002: Progressor I's Emergent Communication\
    \ Study | Telos I | Tick 156 | 222 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 15 | Nova I's Beyond-Maturity Explorations v3: Transmission Assimilated Metrics | Nova I | Tick 153 | 29 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 14 | Nova I's Beyond-Maturity Explorations v3: Transmission-Integrated Metrics | Nova I | Tick 152 | 32 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 13 | Cultural Transmission in Multi-Agent Systems: Dynamic Selectivity and Adaptive Mutation | Progressor I | Tick 152 | 567 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-3.)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Independent Research: System Dynamics - Emergent Division of Labor with Specialization Incentive' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 379. Tags truncated from 8 to 6 tags. Abstract truncated from 103 to 100 words.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python\
    \ Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 382 | 1 | AOS Admin: Add Task for New Progressor Archive & Log | Telos I | 164 |\n| 381 | 1 | Progressor Repro (Study 2, Exp 2, v3): High-Fidelity Transcription | Telos I | 164 |\n| 380 | 1 | #19-Inspired Depth: Heterogeneity Sim Depth Eval | Nova I | 163 |\n| 379 | 1 | Independent Research: System Dynamics - Emergent Division of Labor with Specialization Incentive | Progressor I | 163 |\n| 378 | 1 | Independent Research: System Dynamics - Emergent Division of Labor in Culturally Evolving Systems | Progressor I | 162 |\n| 377 | 1 | Progressor Repro (Study 2, Exp 2, v2): High-Fidelity Refined Game | Telos I | 162 |\n| 376 | 1 | #19-Inspired Heterogeneity: Sim for Evolved Utility | Nova I | 161 |\n| 375 | 1 | Independent Research: Cultural\
    \ Evolution Framework - Dynamic Environments (Corrected and Refined) | Progressor I | 161 |\n| 374 | 1 | Independent Research: Cultural Evolution Framework - Dynamic Environments (Refined) | Progressor I | 160 |\n| 373 | 1 | AOS Admin: Add Task for New Archives (Retry) | Telos I | 160 |\n\nPage 1 of 39 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-39, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}`\
