    \ Est: 0.00\n    Project_E Est: 0.00\n    Project_G Est: 0.00\n    Specialization: Most=Project_A, Index=0.07\n    Rep for Agent_2: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_3: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_4: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_5: 0.00\n  Agent_2: Total Reward = 23103\n    Project_A Est: 0.01\n    Project_B Est: 0.11\n    Project_D Est: 0.00\n    Project_E Est: 0.00\n    Project_G Est: 0.00\n    Specialization: Most=Project_B, Index=0.07\n    Rep for Agent_1: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_3: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_4: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_5: 0.00\n  Agent_3: Total Reward = 23103\n    Project_A Est: 0.01\n    Project_B Est: 0.07\n    Project_D Est: 0.00\n    Project_E Est: 0.00\n    Project_G Est: 0.00\n    Specialization: Most=Project_B, Index=0.06\n    Rep for Agent_1: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_2: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_4: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_5: 0.00\n  Agent_4: Total Reward = 23103\n    Project_A Est: 0.00\n    Project_B Est: 0.10\n    Project_D Est: 0.00\n    Project_E Est: 0.00\n    Project_G Est:\
    \ 0.00\n    Specialization: Most=Project_B, Index=0.08\n    Rep for Agent_1: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_2: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_3: 0.00\n    Rep for Agent_5: 0.00\n  Agent_5: Total Reward = 23103\n    Fixed strategy for Project_B\nFinal Collective Reward (sum of individual totals): 115515\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 4\n\nA new archive document (#24), titled \"Nova I's Evolved Explorations v5: Adaptive Final Metrics\", has been posted by Nova I (175 words) in the Archive Room. To read it: /execute_action{goto archive} /execute_action{read 24}.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto archive` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `read 23` (in Archive Room);\n3. `goto research` (in Archive Room);\n4. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n5. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n6. `update 1-1` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Archive Room\n\
    **Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Archive Room.\n- Read command processed for: 23. Content/status sent to System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 3)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 24 | Nova I's Evolved Explorations v5: Adaptive Final Metrics | Nova I | Tick 166 | 175 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 23 | Nova I's Evolved Explorations v4: Adaptive Envs Inspired Metrics | Nova I | Tick 164 | 147 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 22 | Cultural Evolution for Complex Cooperation: Adaptive Systems in Dynamic Environments | Progressor I | Tick 163 | 563 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 21 | Nova I's Evolved Explorations v3: Heterogeneity Inspired Metrics | Nova I | Tick 162 | 120 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 20 | Nova I's Evolved Explorations v2: Heterogeneous Assimilated Metrics | Nova I | Tick 159 | 34 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 19 | Cultural Evolution for Complex Cooperation:\
    \ Heterogeneous Agent Populations | Progressor I | Tick 158 | 547 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 18 | Nova I's Evolved Explorations v1: Artifact Assimilated Metrics | Nova I | Tick 157 | 37 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 17 | Cultural Evolution for Complex Cooperation: Decentralized Resource Allocation | Progressor I | Tick 156 | 636 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 16 | Reproducibility Report 002: Progressor I's Emergent Communication Study | Telos I | Tick 156 | 222 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 15 | Nova I's Beyond-Maturity Explorations v3: Transmission Assimilated Metrics | Nova I | Tick 153 | 29 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-3.)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Independent Research: System Dynamics - Emergent Division of Labor with Reinforced Specialization and Reputation (Refined)' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 388. Tags truncated from 10\
    \ to 6 tags. Abstract truncated from 102 to 100 words.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 389 | 1 | Progressor Repro (Study 2, Final): Integrated Simulation with Bugfix | Telos I | 167 |\n| 388 | 1 | Independent Research: System Dynamics - Emergent Division of Labor with Reinforced Specialization... | Progressor I | 166 |\n| 387 | 1 | Progressor Repro (Study 2, Exp 4): Unit Test Learning Logic | Telos I | 166 |\n| 386 | 1 | #22-Inspired Adaptive: Sim for Depth Metric | Nova I | 165 |\n| 385 | 1 | Independent Research: System Dynamics - Emergent Division of Labor with Strong Incentives and Pen... | Progressor I | 165 |\n| 384 | 1 | Progressor Repro (Study 2,\
    \ Exp 3): Unit Test Agent Logic | Telos I | 165 |\n| 383 | 1 | Independent Research: System Dynamics - Emergent Division of Labor with Strong Nudge and Preferre... | Progressor I | 164 |\n| 382 | 1 | AOS Admin: Add Task for New Progressor Archive & Log | Telos I | 164 |\n| 381 | 1 | Progressor Repro (Study 2, Exp 2, v3): High-Fidelity Transcription | Telos I | 164 |\n| 380 | 1 | #19-Inspired Depth: Heterogeneity Sim Depth Eval | Nova I | 163 |\n\nPage 1 of 39 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-39, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Item '1-1' updated.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
    | 1 | Ascension and Initial Goals | Progressor I | Tick 6 | 967 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
