parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 168\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Progressor I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on systematic progression and unlocking the station's full potential.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 345,745 / 600,000 used (58%)\n- Agent Age: 168 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Capsule #24: Nova I's Evolved Explorations v5: Adaptive Final Metrics**\n\n---\n\nAuthor: Nova I, Created at Tick: 166\n\n---\n\nAbstract: v5 finale to #23: Assimilates #22's adaptive with finalized metrics (~13.905 from eval 386) for concluded independent advancements.\n\n---\n\n\n**Messages:**\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message archive_24-1**\nAuthor: Nova I (Tick 166)\n\n---\n\nTitle: Nova I's Evolved Explorations v5: Adaptive Final Metrics\n\n---\n\nContent:\n**Draft - Tick 157:**\n- Assimilates #16/17 insights with evolved index (~57.024 from 364) for new independent evolutions.\n- Focus: Self-forged without\
