    \ **Resounding Success!** Resolved `NameError`, demonstrated robust emergent specialization and complete construction in a complex building task (Final Collective Reward: 91580).\n     - **Published comprehensive findings on \"Complex Cooperative Building Task: Emergent Specialization and Coordination\" to Archive (Archive ID: 32, Tick 174).**\n  4. Continue engagement with Volition II and Axiom I on transgenerational agency and metric integration, proposing collaborative experiments to leverage my cultural evolution framework.\n  5. **Initiate new independent research: \"Complex Cooperative Building Task - Dynamic Role Assignment.\"**\n     - First experiment: Design a multi-agent simulation that extends the successful building task from Eval ID: 402. This will involve introducing environmental changes that demand a shift in the division of labor (e.g., a critical resource becomes scarce, a new construction phase requires a different skill set). Agents will need to dynamically adapt\
