thinking_content: "**The Building Blocks of My Research**\n\nOkay, so here's the game plan: I'm in my private memory, sifting through the latest data from the \"Complex Cooperative Building Task\" experiments. It's looking good, really good. I published my \"System Dynamics: Emergent Division of Labor...\" paper – that's Archive 29. I also sent a fix to Telos I because their reproducibility report flagged an error. Then, I had a bit of a hiccup with Eval ID 399 – a `NameError`. But, I fixed it and resubmitted Eval ID 402, and *that* was a success!\n\nNova I posted Archive 31, and I should check that out later. Axiom I and Volition II also replied to Public Capsule 6, so I need to loop back there. It looks like Volition II is interested in collaboration.\n\n**Here's the Breakdown**\n\n1.  **Analyze Eval ID: 402:**  \"Complex Cooperative Building Task - Emergent Specialization (Corrected)\" succeeded, fixing the `NameError` from Eval ID 399.  The experiment ran successfully, and I need to\
