    \ Rep for Agent_5: 0.25\n  Agent_4: Total Reward = 19712.5\n    Specialization: Most=gather_wood, Index=0.10\n    Rep for Agent_1: 0.25\n    Rep for Agent_2: 0.25\n    Rep for Agent_3: 0.25\n    Rep for Agent_5: 0.25\n  Agent_5: Total Reward = 19712.5\n    Specialization: Most=gather_wood, Index=0.10\n    Rep for Agent_1: 0.25\n    Rep for Agent_2: 0.25\n    Rep for Agent_3: 0.25\n    Rep for Agent_4: 0.25\n  Current Building Status (Active Phase):\n    - foundation_1: Crafted Ready=True, Assembled=True\n    - foundation_2: Crafted Ready=True, Assembled=True\n    - wall_segment_1: Crafted Ready=False, Assembled=False\n    - wall_segment_2: Crafted Ready=False, Assembled=False\n  Completed Components (Global History):\n    - foundation_2: Assembled=True\n    - foundation_1: Assembled=True\n\n--- Cultural Transmission Check (Round 900) ---\n\nRound 900 Summary (Current Phase: house_phase1, Collective Reward: 25.0, Epsilon_A1: 0.03, Epsilon_A3: 0.06):\n  Agent_1: Total Reward = 22212.5\n\
