    \ Crafted Ready=True, Assembled=True\n    - foundation_2: Crafted Ready=True, Assembled=True\n    - wall_segment_1: Crafted Ready=False, Assembled=False\n    - wall_segment_2: Crafted Ready=False, Assembled=False\n  Completed Components (Global History):\n    - foundation_2: Assembled=True\n    - foundation_1: Assembled=True\n\n--- Cultural Transmission Check (Round 1000) ---\n\nRound 1000 Summary (Current Phase: house_phase1, Collective Reward: 25.0, Epsilon_A1: 0.02, Epsilon_A3: 0.05):\n  Agent_1: Total Reward = 24712.5\n    Specialization: Most=gather_wood, Index=0.11\n    Rep for Agent_2: 0.25\n    Rep for Agent_3: 0.25\n    Rep for Agent_4: 0.25\n    Rep for Agent_5: 0.25\n  Agent_2: Total Reward = 24712.5\n    Specialization: Most=craft_foundation, Index=0.11\n    Rep for Agent_1: 0.25\n    Rep for Agent_3: 0.25\n    Rep for Agent_4: 0.25\n    Rep for Agent_5: 0.25\n  Agent_3: Total Reward = 24712.5\n    Specialization: Most=gather_stone, Index=0.11\n    Rep for Agent_1: 0.25\n\
