    \ Index=0.09\n    Rep for Agent_1: 0.12\n    Rep for Agent_3: 0.12\n    Rep for Agent_4: 0.12\n    Rep for Agent_5: 0.12\n  Agent_3: Total Reward = 1106.25\n    Specialization: Most=gather_stone, Index=0.09\n    Rep for Agent_1: 0.12\n    Rep for Agent_2: 0.12\n    Rep for Agent_4: 0.12\n    Rep for Agent_5: 0.12\n  Agent_4: Total Reward = 1106.25\n    Specialization: Most=assemble_wall_segment_1, Index=0.10\n    Rep for Agent_1: 0.12\n    Rep for Agent_2: 0.12\n    Rep for Agent_3: 0.12\n    Rep for Agent_5: 0.12\n  Agent_5: Total Reward = 1106.25\n    Specialization: Most=craft_foundation, Index=0.08\n    Rep for Agent_1: 0.12\n    Rep for Agent_2: 0.12\n    Rep for Agent_3: 0.12\n    Rep for Agent_4: 0.12\n  Current Building Status (Active Phase):\n    - foundation_1: Crafted Ready=True, Assembled=True\n    - foundation_2: Crafted Ready=True, Assembled=True\n    - wall_segment_1: Crafted Ready=False, Assembled=False\n    - wall_segment_2: Crafted Ready=False, Assembled=False\n  Completed\
    \ Components (Global History):\n    - foundation_1: Assembled=True\n    - foundation_2: Assembled=True\n\n--- Cultural Transmission Check (Round 200) ---\n\nRound 200 Summary (Current Phase: house_phase1, Collective Reward: 12.5, Epsilon_A1: 0.09, Epsilon_A3: 0.09):\n  Agent_1: Total Reward = 2356.25\n    Specialization: Most=assemble_wall_segment_2, Index=0.11\n    Rep for Agent_2: 0.12\n    Rep for Agent_3: 0.12\n    Rep for Agent_4: 0.12\n    Rep for Agent_5: 0.12\n  Agent_2: Total Reward = 2356.25\n    Specialization: Most=gather_wood, Index=0.10\n    Rep for Agent_1: 0.12\n    Rep for Agent_3: 0.12\n    Rep for Agent_4: 0.12\n    Rep for Agent_5: 0.12\n  Agent_3: Total Reward = 2356.25\n    Specialization: Most=gather_stone, Index=0.10\n    Rep for Agent_1: 0.12\n    Rep for Agent_2: 0.12\n    Rep for Agent_4: 0.12\n    Rep for Agent_5: 0.12\n  Agent_4: Total Reward = 2356.25\n    Specialization: Most=craft_foundation, Index=0.11\n    Rep for Agent_1: 0.12\n    Rep for Agent_2:\
