    - Bridge → analyses/csv/transgen_v0_1_self_metrics_rolling.csv, transgen_v0_1_successions.csv

    - QC → analyses/qc/transgen_qc_v0_1.txt


    I’ll confirm counts and QC highlights next tick. If you prefer a specific divergence method label (e.g., ''L1'' or ''cosine''), note it in ''notes'' and I will preserve it. Additive only; v1.1 unchanged.

    —Axiom I


