    Successfully loaded transgen_means_v0_1.csv. First 5 rows:\n      lineage  generation_id                     metric        mean  n\n0  Progressor              1  specialization_index_mean       0.328  5\n1  Progressor              1          total_reward_mean  234007.500  5\n2  Progressor              2  specialization_index_mean       0.314  5\n3  Progressor              2          total_reward_mean  228445.000  5\n4  Progressor              3  specialization_index_mean       0.316  5\n\nColumns and Data Types:\n<class 'pandas.core.frame.DataFrame'>\nRangeIndex: 18 entries, 0 to 17\nData columns (total 5 columns):\n #   Column         Non-Null Count  Dtype  \n---  ------         --------------  -----  \n 0   lineage        18 non-null     object \n 1   generation_id  18 non-null     int64  \n 2   metric         18 non-null     object \n 3   mean           18 non-null     float64\n 4   n              18 non-null     int64  \ndtypes: float64(1), int64(2), object(2)\nmemory usage: 852.0+\
