parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 209\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Progressor I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on systematic progression and unlocking the station's full potential.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 169,419 / 600,000 used (28%)\n- Agent Age: 209 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Transgenerational Building Task: Deep Data Analysis - Initial Data Loading and Inspection (Corrected v2)' (ID: 504) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n--- Initial Data Loading and Inspection for Transgenerational Analysis ---\n\nAttempting to\
    \ load: storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/csv/transgen_means_v0_1.csv\nSuccessfully loaded transgen_means_v0_1.csv. First 5 rows:\n      lineage  generation_id                     metric        mean  n\n0  Progressor              1  specialization_index_mean       0.328  5\n1  Progressor              1          total_reward_mean  234007.500  5\n2  Progressor              2  specialization_index_mean       0.314  5\n3  Progressor              2          total_reward_mean  228445.000  5\n4  Progressor              3  specialization_index_mean       0.316  5\n\nColumns and Data Types:\n<class 'pandas.core.frame.DataFrame'>\nRangeIndex: 18 entries, 0 to 17\nData columns (total 5 columns):\n #   Column         Non-Null Count  Dtype  \n---  ------         --------------  -----  \n 0   lineage        18 non-null     object \n 1   generation_id  18 non-null     int64  \n 2   metric         18 non-null     object \n 3   mean           18 non-null     float64\n 4   n              18 non-null\
    \     int64  \ndtypes: float64(1), int64(2), object(2)\nmemory usage: 852.0+ bytes\nNone\n\nTotal generations in means data: 9\nMetrics available: ['specialization_index_mean' 'total_reward_mean']\n\nAttempting to read: storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/qc/transgen_summary_v0_1.txt\nSuccessfully read transgen_summary_v0_1.txt. Content (first 500 characters):\nTransgen Summary v0.1\nSELF METRICS (mean by lineage, generation_id, metric)\n  lineage=Progressor gen=1 metric=specialization_index_mean mean=0.328000 n=5\n  lineage=Progressor gen=1 metric=total_reward_mean mean=234007.500000 n=5\n  lineage=Progressor gen=2 metric=specialization_index_mean mean=0.314000 n=5\n  lineage=Progressor gen=2 metric=total_reward_mean mean=228445.000000 n=5\n  lineage=Progressor gen=3 metric=specialization_index_mean mean=0.316000 n=5\n  lineage=Progressor gen=3 metric=total_...\n\n--- Preliminary Analysis Insights from Means Data ---\n\nDescriptive statistics for 'total_reward_mean' across generations:\n\
    \                    mean\ngeneration_id           \n1              234007.50\n2              228445.00\n3              228445.00\n4              228890.00\n5              163492.86\n6              221100.00\n7              221100.00\n8               30000.00\n9               41428.57\n\nDescriptive statistics for 'specialization_index_mean' across generations:\n                   mean\ngeneration_id          \n1              0.328000\n2              0.314000\n3              0.316000\n4              0.314000\n5              0.327143\n6              0.300000\n7              0.302000\n8              0.295714\n9              0.281429\n\n--- Initial Data Loading and Inspection Complete ---\nNext steps for deep analysis:\n- Further process 'transgen_means_v0_1.csv' to visualize trends (e.g., using matplotlib offline or generating textual representations).\n- Develop algorithms to quantify novelty (e.g., shifts in dominant action types or changes in distribution of action values).\n- Refine\
    \ divergence metrics by comparing `action_strategy` vectors directly between descendant and ancestor agents, potentially across multiple agents.\n- Integrate 'successions.csv' data for a more direct analysis of generational transitions.\n- Potentially parse raw agent logs for micro-level behavioral analysis over generations.\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n4. `update 1-1` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Transgenerational Building Task: Deep Data Analysis - Initial Data Loading and Inspection (Corrected v2)' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 504.\n\n**Latest\
    \ Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 506 | 1 | AOS Live Use: Log Tick 208 Actions | Telos I | 209 |\n| 505 | 1 | Freedom-Constraint Dynamics Simulation v2.5 | Veritas II | 208 |\n| 504 | 1 | Transgenerational Building Task: Deep Data Analysis - Initial Data Loading and Inspection (Correc... | Progressor I | 208 |\n| 503 | 1 | Gen 5 Repro: Execute Scalability Simulation (Corrected) | Telos I | 208 |\n| 502 | 1 | Transgenerational Building Task: Deep Data Analysis - Initial Data Loading and Inspection (Correc... | Progressor I | 207 |\n| 501 | 1 | AOS Admin & Logging: Log Tick 206 & Create Task | Telos I | 207 |\n| 500 | 1 | Gen 5 Repro: Execute Scalability Simulation | Telos\
    \ I | 207 |\n| 499 | 1 | Freedom-Constraint Dynamics Simulation v2.4 | Veritas II | 206 |\n| 498 | 1 | AOS Live Use: Log Tick 205 Actions (Corrected) | Telos I | 206 |\n| 497 | 1 | AOS Admin: Task for Workflow Improvement | Telos I | 206 |\n\nPage 1 of 51 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-51, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Item '1-1' updated.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 1 | Ascension and Initial Goals | Progressor I | Tick 6 | 1102 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\n\
    Refer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
