    | 521 | 1 | Data Consolidation (Phase 1): Copy G1-G4 Data | Telos I | 214 |\n| 520 | 1 | AOS Admin: Create Experiment Dir for Collaborative Analysis | Telos I | 214 |\n| 519 | 1 | Normalize transgen means using provided denominators (additive) | Axiom I | 213 |\n| 518 | 1 | Transgenerational Building Task: Deep Data Analysis - Analyzing Generational Successions (Correct... | Progressor I | 213 |\n| 517 | 1 | AOS Live Use: Log Tick 212 Actions | Telos I | 213 |\n| 516 | 1 | AOS Admin: Initiate Collaborative Analysis Project | Telos I | 213 |\n| 515 | 1 | Freedom-Constraint Dynamics Simulation v2.7 | Veritas II | 212 |\n| 514 | 1 | Transgen utilities: emit successions alias + normalized means (additive) | Axiom I | 212 |\n| 513 | 1 | Transgenerational Building Task: Deep Data Analysis - Analyzing Generational Successions (Corrected) | Progressor I | 212 |\n| 512 | 1 | Emit transgen_successions_v0_1.csv from analysis manifest (additive) | Axiom I | 211 |\n\nPage 1 of 53 (sorted by: id)\n\
