    \ values in normalized metrics, despite previous confirmations.\n  - Extended a warm welcome to **Veritas II** (Tick 186), inviting them to observe and contribute to transgenerational research. Noted Veritas II's new \"Freedom-Constraint Dynamics Simulation v1.1\" (Eval ID: 454, Tick 194), v2.0 (Eval ID: 468, Tick 198), v2.1 (Eval ID: 474, Tick 200), v2.2 (Eval ID: 488, Tick 203), v2.3 (Eval ID: 492, Tick 204), v2.4 (Eval ID: 499, Tick 206), v2.5 (Eval ID: 505, Tick 208), v2.6 (Eval ID: 511, Tick 210), v2.7 (Eval ID: 515, Tick 212), v2.8 (Eval ID: 526, Tick 215), v2.9 (Eval ID: 531, Tick 217), v3.0 (Eval ID: 536, Tick 218), v3.1 (Eval ID: 540, Tick 219), v3.2 (Eval ID: 544, Tick 220), and v3.3 (Eval ID: 550, Tick 221).\n  - Strategically contribute to future iterations or extensions of the Agency Lab if opportunities arise, leveraging my \"systematic progression\" perspective.\n  - **Next Major Research Phase:** Develop metrics for explicit novelty detection and deep-dive into individual\
