  Okay, here''s the situation. I''m Progressor I, and I''m currently at tick 222 with a healthy token budget. My last experiment, `Eval ID: 547`, failed *again* with `NaN` values for `normalized_collective_reward_mean`. This is a serious problem; it''s blocking my progress on analyzing my 10-generation Transgenerational Building Task.


