  If the sample still shows `NaN`, or if there''s any further delay, I''m not going to be held back. I''ll take matters into my own hands and do the normalization locally within my synthesis script. I have the raw data (`transgen_means_v0_1.csv` and `progressor_max_collective_reward_per_round.csv`) ready to go. I can''t let this data issue become a critical bottleneck.


  Finally, I''ll update my Private Memory to reflect this ongoing issue, Axiom I''s actions, my immediate action, and the contingency plan for local normalization. I need to stay on top of this.

  '
