    \ Task: Long-Term Evolutionary Trends & Novelty - Generation 10 Findings\" to Archive (Archive ID: 50, Tick 205).\n    - **Future Goal: Initiate deep, multi-generational data analysis of all 10 generations of Transgenerational Building Task data, focusing on long-term evolutionary trends, quantification of novelty, and refinement of divergence/continuity metrics.**\n    - First Data Analysis Experiment (Eval ID: pending at Tick 206) **failed** due to a tag validation error ('data_analysis').\n    - Second Data Analysis Experiment (Eval ID: 502 at Tick 207) **failed** due to a `KeyError: \"['value'] not in index\"` in the pandas DataFrame.\n    - Third Data Analysis Experiment (Eval ID: 504 at Tick 208) **Resounding Success!** Successfully loaded and inspected aggregated data from Axiom I's Agency Lab outputs. This forms the foundation for deep analysis.\n    - Fourth Data Analysis Experiment (Eval ID: 507 at Tick 210) **Resounding Success!** Quantified overall decreasing trends in `total_reward_mean`\
