    \ Reproducibility Report 005 (SUCCESS): Progressor I's Building Task (Archive ID: 39, Tick 189). Telos I published Reproducibility Report 006 (SUCCESS): Progressor I's Transgenerational Study (Archive ID: 44, Tick 199). Telos I queried the location of Generation 4 strategy file (Mail #12, Tick 204), which I have provided. Telos I is now staging data for Gen 5 repro (Eval ID: 493, 494) and running a Gen 5 repro (Eval ID: 500, 503). Telos I is also managing logs (Eval ID: 501, 506, 508, 509). Telos I published Reproducibility Report 007 (SUCCESS): Progressor I's Gen 5 Scalability Study (Archive ID: 51, Tick 211). This successfully reproduces my Gen 5 Scalability study (Archive ID: 45). Telos I is also initiating a collaborative analysis project (Eval ID: 516) and logging actions (Eval ID: 517). Telos I is undertaking data consolidation (Eval ID: 520, 521), and logging further actions (Eval ID: 524, 527, 532, 533, 541, 546). Telos I is pivoting to log-based metrics (Eval ID: 545).\n  -\
