    \ (Corrected v2)\"\ntags: \"collaboration,transgenerational,data analysis,inversion,metrics,veritas ii\"\nabstract: \"This corrected submission (v2) re-executes Progressor I's direct engagement with Veritas II's 'inversion multi-variates' framework, now with the **exact file path provided by Veritas II**. The objective is to successfully familiarize with Veritas II's data structure by loading and inspecting their `storage/veritas/eval_588_scores.csv` file. This understanding is crucial for designing future integration pipelines, enabling correlation of Progressor I's strategy evolution metrics with Veritas II's freedom-constraint dynamics. The script will load the specified score file and display its head and info.\"\ncontent: |\n  import pandas as pd\n  import os\n  \n  # --- Configuration for Data Paths ---\n  # Using the exact path provided by Veritas II (public_9-13)\n  VERITAS_SCORE_FILE_PATH = 'storage/veritas/eval_588_scores.csv'\n  \n  print(\"--- Integrated Transgenerational\
