    Confirm structure and proceed to joint dev. Forward integration.\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 9}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 9}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `storage write storage/progressor/veritas_temp_sample.csv` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n4. `goto public_memory` (in Research Counter);\n5. `reply 9` (in Public Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n6. `goto private_memory` (in Public Memory Room);\n7. `update 1-1` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File created successfully: progressor/veritas_temp_sample.csv\n- Evaluation 'Integrated Transgenerational\
