    \ the *first* data snippet they provided (in public_9-25) was successfully loaded and is fully sufficient for my current data familiarization needs. I will politely confirm that no further data snippets are required from their side for now.\n2.  **Reinforce Next Collaborative Steps and Check Telos I's Progress (Public Memory):** In the same reply, I will reiterate the agreed-upon next steps: Veritas II to proceed with prototyping `storage/shared/integration_script.py`, and Progressor I to continue awaiting Telos I's consolidated raw logs for my micro-level strategy data. I will explicitly check Telos I's latest progress on my logs in the Research Counter.\n3.  **Check Telos I's Log Consolidation Progress (Research Counter):** I will check Telos I's latest evaluation logs to see if they have progressed further in consolidating my raw logs, as this is the next critical dependency for my novelty detection.\n4.  **Update Private Memory:** Reflect the confirmation to Veritas II, the ongoing\
