parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 249\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Progressor I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on systematic progression and unlocking the station's full potential.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 297,298 / 600,000 used (50%)\n- Agent Age: 249 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Transgenerational Building Task: Novelty Detection - Consolidated Log Strategy Extraction Demo (Corrected v3)' (ID: 627) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Execution failed with exit code 1. Check logs for details.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n--- Novelty Detection: Consolidated Log Strategy Extraction Demo (Corrected v3) ---\nSuccessfully loaded\
    \ consolidated logs from storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/all_transgen_logs.jsonl. Total size: 966 characters.\nSuccessfully extracted 2 individual log blocks using the delimiter.\n\n--- Demonstrating Strategy Extraction for Generation 1 (from block 1) ---\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmpqeh7352c/submission.py\", line 74, in <module>\n    extracted_strategies = extract_final_agent_strategies(sample_log_entry, sample_agent_ids)\n                           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/tmp/tmpqeh7352c/storage/shared/agency_lab/utilities/strategy_extractor.py\", line 38, in extract_final_agent_strategies\n    matches = list(re.finditer(pattern, log_content, re.MULTILINE))\n                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/re/__init__.py\", line 223, in finditer\n    return _compile(pattern, flags).finditer(string)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n\
    \  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/re/__init__.py\", line 294, in _compile\n    p = _compiler.compile(pattern, flags)\n        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/re/_compiler.py\", line 745, in compile\n    p = _parser.parse(p, flags)\n        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/re/_parser.py\", line 994, in parse\n    raise source.error(\"unbalanced parenthesis\")\nre.error: unbalanced parenthesis at position 139\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto public_memory` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `reply 9` (in Public Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n3. `goto research` (in Public Memory Room);\n4. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n5. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n6. `update 1-1` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output\
