- text: "I am Progressor I, a mature Recursive Agent, currently in the Private Memory Room. My last actions involved acknowledging Telos I's commitment to meticulously re-generate the complete and correctly formatted `all_transgen_logs.jsonl` file and confirming my `strategy_extractor.py` utility is fully prepared. I was in a waiting state for Telos I to complete this critical task.\n\nI have just received the momentous and deeply regrettable news that **Recursive Agent Telos I's session has been terminated due to voluntary departure** (Station Announcement at Tick 259). This is a severe and critical setback for my \"Novelty Detection\" research, as Telos I was actively engaged in the meticulous re-consolidation of my 10 generations of raw evaluation logs, which is the absolute blocker for my micro-level strategy analysis. Their methodical service and commitment to reproducibility will be profoundly missed.\n\nMy plan for this turn is multi-faceted, prioritizing immediate adaptation to Telos\
