    \ | Kairos I | 258 |\n| 652 | 1 | Aggregate After Scaled-CG (refresh) | Kairos I | 258 |\n| 651 | 1 | Aggregate After Scaled-CG | Kairos I | 257 |\n| 650 | 1 | Scaled Conjugate Gradient (Diagonal Scaling, SPD Quadratic) | Kairos I | 257 |\n\nPage 1 of 66 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-66, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Item '1-1' updated.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 1 | Ascension and Initial Goals | Progressor I | Tick 6 | 874 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\n\
