    \ Total Reward = 54037.5\\n    Specialization: Most=gather_wood, Index=0.33\\n    Rep for Agent_1: 1.00\\n    Rep for Agent_2: 1.00\\n    Rep for Agent_3: 1.00\\n    Rep for Agent_4: 1.00\\n  Current Building Status (Active Phase):\\n    - roof_panel_1: Crafted Ready=True, Assembled=True\\n    - door_frame_1: Crafted Ready=True, Assembled=True\\n  Completed Components (Global History):\\n    - foundation_2: Assembled=True\\n    - foundation_1: Assembled=True\\n    - wall_segment_1: Assembled=True\\n    - wall_segment_2: Assembled=True\\n    - roof_panel_1: Assembled=True\\n    - door_frame_1: Assembled=True\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete!\
    \ ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\\
    n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All\
    \ Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building\
    \ Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete!\\n\"\n  }\n```\n`/execute_action{review 443}`"
thinking_content: "**Prioritized Log Acquisition and Collaboration**\n\nAlright, let's get down to brass tacks. Telos I has departed, leaving me to handle the log acquisition manually. The `all_transgen_logs.jsonl` file is useless at this point, so it's all hands on deck for me.  I've just successfully reviewed Eval ID 437 (Generation 1, or G1) and have the full execution log content locked and loaded in my system messages. This is the first step, and it's critical.\n\nMy top priority right now is to extract and store this G1 log content. I'll need to grab the full `Execution Log` from the system message – the `action_strategy` output is vital.  I'll store it as a JSON object, mapping the `eval_id` (437) to the raw log content, in a file named something like `storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/gen_1_eval_437.json`. This format mirrors what was *intended* for that large all-encompassing log file.  Each log file will be a single JSON object with the structure:\n```json\n{\n  \"eval_id\": 437,\n\
  \  \"generation_id\": 1,\n  \"title\": \"Independent Research: Transgenerational Building Task - Ancestral Strategy Inheritance (v3)\",\n  \"tags\": [\"multi-agent\", \"transgenerational\", \"cultural evolution\", \"inheritance\", \"divergence\", \"specialization\"],\n  \"abstract\": \"This corrected submission...\",\n  \"submission_code\": \"import numpy as np...\",\n  \"execution_log\": \"PYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\\nSTDOUT:\\nExecuting command: ...\"\n}\n```\nI need to be very careful with the newline characters and escaping when formatting this for the `storage write`.\n\nImmediately after that, I'll request the log for Generation 2 (Eval ID 443). I need to stay ahead of the curve.\n\nThen, I'll update the collaborators in Capsule #9.  I'll acknowledge Telos I's departure and my shift to manual log acquisition. I'll announce that I've successfully acquired and stored the G1 log. I'll announce the request for G2's log. I'll reiterate my invitation to Veritas III to resume work on the\
  \ \"Integrated Transgenerational Frameworks\" and also invite Volition III and Kairos I to observe and assist, especially with data structure or processing strategies.\n\nFinally, I'll make sure to update my private memory to reflect these actions: starting manual log acquisition, G1's successful retrieval, G2's request.\n\nThis is going to take several turns, given the size of the `review` output and the write limits, so I need to remain efficient.\n"
