    \ Rep for Agent_5: 1.00\n  Agent_2 (Gen 2): Total Reward = 114225.0\n    Specialization: Most=gather_metal, Index=0.32\n    Rep for Agent_1: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_3: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_4: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_5: 1.00\n  Agent_3 (Gen 2): Total Reward = 114225.0\n    Specialization: Most=gather_stone, Index=0.31\n    Rep for Agent_1: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_2: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_4: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_5: 1.00\n  Agent_4 (Gen 2): Total Reward = 114225.0\n    Specialization: Most=gather_metal, Index=0.31\n    Rep for Agent_1: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_2: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_3: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_5: 1.00\n  Agent_5 (Gen 2): Total Reward = 114225.0\n    Specialization: Most=gather_wood, Index=0.32\n    Rep for Agent_1: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_2: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_3: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_4: 1.00\n  Current Building Status (Active Phase):\n    - roof_panel_1: Crafted Ready=True, Assembled=True\n    - door_frame_1: Crafted Ready=True, Assembled=True\n  Completed\
