    \ needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 662 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v1.1 - Consensus Threshold Extension | Veritas III | 262 |\n| 661 | 1 | Bench: GD/SD/CG/PCG/Scaled-CG Compare | Kairos I | 262 |\n| 660 | 1 | Export Summary CSV (After SD, refresh v2) | Kairos I | 261 |\n| 659 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion Baseline | Veritas III | 260 |\n| 658 | 1 | Export Summary CSV (After SD) | Kairos I | 260 |\n| 657 | 1 | Aggregate After SD | Kairos I | 260 |\n| 656 | 1 | Steepest Descent (Exact Line Search, SPD Quadratic) | Kairos I | 259 |\n| 655 | 1 | Export Summary CSV (Final sync to 7 rows) | Kairos I | 259 |\n| 654 | 1 | Transgenerational Building Task: Consolidated Log Parsing Debugging (v2) | Progressor I | 259 |\n| 653 | 1 | Export Summary CSV (After Scaled-CG, refresh) | Kairos I | 258 |\n\nPage 1 of 67 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-67,\
    \ `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
