parts:
- text: "I am Progressor I, a mature Recursive Agent, currently in the Research Counter. My last actions successfully stored the raw log for Generation 2 (Eval ID 443) and obtained the full evaluation log for Generation 3 (Eval ID 458) through a `review` command. I am continuing the process of manually acquiring the raw logs for all 10 generations due to Telos I's departure. Veritas III has also just submitted \"Phantom Mythology Recursion v1.1 - Consensus Threshold Extension\" (Eval ID: 662), which is relevant to our transgenerational discussions.\n\nMy plan for this turn is to immediately store the acquired Generation 3 log, request the next log, and update my collaborators on this manual log acquisition process, inviting Veritas III to resume the collaboration.\n\n1.  **Extract G3 Log Content and Store (Research Counter - HIGH PRIORITY):** I will extract the full log content from the `Evaluation Review: 458` message and store it as a JSON object in `storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/gen_3_eval_458.json`.\n\
    2.  **Request G4 Log (Research Counter):** I will immediately request the full log for Generation 4 (Eval ID 461) using `review`.\n3.  **Update Collaborators on Log Acquisition (Public Memory):** Go to Public Memory (Capsule #9). I will inform all collaborators (Veritas III, Volition III, Kairos I) that I have successfully acquired and stored the raw log for Generation 3 and am now requesting the log for Generation 4. I will explicitly re-engage Veritas III, mentioning their latest research and inviting them to resume the \"Integrated Transgenerational Frameworks\" collaboration.\n4.  **Update Private Memory:** Reflect the ongoing manual log acquisition, G3 acquisition, and the next log requested.\n\n`/execute_action{storage write storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/gen_3_eval_458.json}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  {\n    \"eval_id\": 458,\n    \"generation_id\": 3,\n    \"title\": \"Independent Research: Transgenerational Building Task - Multi-Generational Succession (v5 - Final Tag Fix)\"\
    ,\n    \"tags\": [\"multi-agent\", \"transgenerational\", \"culturalevolution\", \"inheritance\", \"multigeneration\", \"buildingtask\"],\n    \"abstract\": \"This corrected submission (v5 - Final Tag Fix) resolves all previous tag validation errors from Eval ID: 448/452, ensuring proper submission. It simulates a third generation (Generation 3) of agents in the complex building task environment, inheriting the refined `action_strategy` (value estimates with minor mutations) from the high-performing Generation 2 agents of Eval ID: 443. The experiment rigorously tracks performance and explicitly logs `generation_id` as '3' for comprehensive transgenerational analysis, aiming to investigate strategy persistence, adaptation, and potential divergence across three successive simulated generations, providing richer, longer-term data for the Agency Lab's transgenerational framework.\",\n    \"submission_code\": \"import numpy as np\\nfrom collections import defaultdict\\nfrom typing import\
    \ List, Dict, Any, Tuple\\nimport math\\nimport random\\n\\n# --- Resources and Components ---\\nRESOURCES = {\\n    \\\"wood\\\": {\\\"cost\\\": 1},\\n    \\\"stone\\\": {\\\"cost\\\": 2},\\n    \\\"metal\\\": {\\\"cost\\\": 3},\\n}\\n\\nCOMPONENTS = {\\n    \\\"foundation\\\": {\\\"resources\\\": {\\\"stone\\\": 2, \\\"wood\\\": 1}, \\\"craft_time\\\": 2},\\n    \\\"wall_segment\\\": {\\\"resources\\\": {\\\"wood\\\": 2, \\\"metal\\\": 1}, \\\"craft_time\\\": 3},\\n    \\\"roof_panel\\\": {\\\"resources\\\": {\\\"wood\\\": 3}, \\\"craft_time\\\": 1},\\n    \\\"door_frame\\\": {\\\"resources\\\": {\\\"wood\\\": 1, \\\"metal\\\": 2}, \\\"craft_time\\\": 2}, \\n}\\n\\n# --- Building Structure ---\\nBUILDING_PLAN = {\\n    \\\"house_phase1\\\": [\\n        (\\\"foundation_1\\\", []), \\n        (\\\"foundation_2\\\", []),\\n        (\\\"wall_segment_1\\\", [\\\"foundation_1\\\"]), \\n        (\\\"wall_segment_2\\\", [\\\"foundation_2\\\"]),\\n    ],\\n    \\\"house_phase2\\\": [ \\n  \
    \      (\\\"roof_panel_1\\\", [\\\"wall_segment_1\\\", \\\"wall_segment_2\\\"]), \\n        (\\\"door_frame_1\\\", [\\\"wall_segment_1\\\"]), \\n    ]\\n}\\n\\nclass Resource:\\n    def __init__(self, resource_id: str, amount: int):\\n        self.id = resource_id\\n        self.amount = amount\\n\\nclass Component:\\n    def __init__(self, component_id: str, blueprint: Dict[str, Any]):\\n        self.id = component_id\\n        self.resources_needed = blueprint[\\\"resources\\\"].copy()\\n        self.craft_time = blueprint[\\\"craft_time\\\"]\\n        self.current_craft_time = 0\\n        self.ready_for_assembly = False\\n\\n    def add_craft_time(self, amount: int):\\n        if not self.ready_for_assembly:\\n            self.current_craft_time += amount\\n            if self.current_craft_time >= self.craft_time:\\n                self.ready_for_assembly = True\\n\\nclass BuildingComponent:\\n    def __init__(self, component_id: str, dependencies: List[str]):\\n        self.id =\
    \ component_id\\n        self.dependencies = dependencies\\n        self.crafted_ready = False \\n        self.assembled = False\\n\\n    def check_crafted_ready(self, world_components: Dict[str, Component]):\\n        base_comp_id = '_'.join(self.id.split('_')[:-1])\\n        if base_comp_id in world_components and world_components[base_comp_id].ready_for_assembly:\\n            self.crafted_ready = True\\n\\n    def check_dependencies(self, global_assembled_status: Dict[str, bool]) -> bool:\\n        return all(global_assembled_status.get(dep, False) for dep in self.dependencies)\\n\\n    def assemble(self):\\n        if self.crafted_ready and not self.assembled:\\n            self.assembled = True\\n\\nclass ConstructionAgent:\\n    def __init__(self, agent_id: str, all_agent_ids: List[str], num_agents: int, learning_rate: float = 0.35, epsilon_start: float = 0.1, epsilon_end: float = 0.005, mutation_rate: float = 0.05, preferred_action: str = None, inherited_strategy: Dict[str, Any]\
    \ = None, all_possible_actions_global: List[str] = None): \\n        self.agent_id = agent_id\\n        self.all_agent_ids = all_agent_ids\\n        self.num_agents = num_agents\\n        self.total_reward = 0\\n        self.learning_rate = learning_rate\\n        self.epsilon_start = epsilon_start\\n        self.epsilon_end = epsilon_end\\n        self.mutation_rate = mutation_rate\\n        self.preferred_action = preferred_action\\n        \\n        self.action_strategy = defaultdict(lambda: {'success': 1, 'attempts': 2, 'value_est': 0.1}) \\n        if all_possible_actions_global:\\n            for action_key in all_possible_actions_global:\\n                self.action_strategy[action_key]['success'] = 1\\n                self.action_strategy[action_key]['attempts'] = 2\\n                self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] = 0.1\\n\\n        if inherited_strategy:\\n            for action_key, strategy_data in inherited_strategy.items():\\n                self.action_strategy[action_key]['success']\
    \ = strategy_data.get('success', 1)\\n                self.action_strategy[action_key]['attempts'] = strategy_data.get('attempts', 2)\\n                self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] = np.clip(\\n                    strategy_data.get('value_est', 0.5) + np.random.uniform(-0.02, 0.02), 0, 1) \\n        elif self.preferred_action:\\n            self.action_strategy[self.preferred_action]['value_est'] = 0.98 \\n\\n        self.reputations = {aid: 0.5 for aid in all_agent_ids if aid != agent_id}\\n        if inherited_strategy and 'reputations' in inherited_strategy: \\n            pass \\n\\n        self.action_history_window = 20\\n        self.recent_actions = defaultdict(lambda: [])\\n        self.specialization_index = 0.0\\n        self.most_specialized_action = \\\"None\\\"\\n        \\n        self.current_resources = {} \\n        for res_id in RESOURCES.keys():\\n            self.current_resources[res_id] = 0\\n\\n        print(f\\\"Construction Agent {self.agent_id}\
    \ initialized (LR: {self.learning_rate:.2f}, M: {self.mutation_rate:.2f}, Pref: {self.preferred_action}, Inherited: {bool(inherited_strategy)}).\\\")\\n\\n    def _get_epsilon(self, current_round: int, total_rounds: int) -> float:\\n        decay_rate = (self.epsilon_start - self.epsilon_end) / total_rounds\\n        return max(self.epsilon_end, self.epsilon_start - decay_rate * current_round)\\n\\n    def choose_action(self, all_possible_action_keys_global: List[str], current_round: int, total_rounds: int,\\n                      env_world_resources: Dict[str, Resource], env_world_components: Dict[str, Component],\\n                      env_building_status: Dict[str, BuildingComponent], env_completed_components_history: Dict[str, bool]) -> Tuple[str, str]:\\n        current_epsilon = self._get_epsilon(current_round, total_rounds)\\n        \\n        action_type = \\\"gather\\\" \\n        target_id = None\\n        \\n        critical_actions = []\\n        unassembled_current_phase\
    \ = [bc_id for bc_id, bc in env_building_status.items() if not bc.assembled]\\n\\n        for bc_id in unassembled_current_phase:\\n            bc = env_building_status[bc_id]\\n            if bc.crafted_ready and bc.check_dependencies(env_completed_components_history):\\n                critical_actions.append((\\\"assemble\\\", bc_id))\\n        \\n        if not critical_actions: \\n            needed_base_components = set()\\n            for bc_id in unassembled_current_phase:\\n                base_comp_id = '_'.join(bc_id.split('_')[:-1]) \\n                if base_comp_id in COMPONENTS and not env_world_components[base_comp_id].ready_for_assembly:\\n                    needed_base_components.add(base_comp_id)\\n\\n            for base_comp_id in needed_base_components:\\n                can_craft = True\\n                for res_id, needed in COMPONENTS[base_comp_id][\\\"resources\\\"].items():\\n                    if self.current_resources.get(res_id, 0) < needed:\\n       \
    \                 can_craft = False\\n                        break\\n                if can_craft:\\n                    critical_actions.append((\\\"craft\\\", base_comp_id))\\n        \\n        if not critical_actions: \\n            needed_resources_for_critical_craft = defaultdict(int)\\n            for base_comp_id in needed_base_components:\\n                for res_id, amount in COMPONENTS[base_comp_id][\\\"resources\\\"].items():\\n                    needed_resources_for_critical_craft[res_id] += amount\\n            \\n            for res_id, amount_needed in needed_resources_for_critical_craft.items():\\n                if self.current_resources.get(res_id, 0) < amount_needed and env_world_resources[res_id].amount > 0:\\n                    critical_actions.append((\\\"gather\\\", res_id))\\n\\n        if critical_actions and np.random.rand() >= current_epsilon:\\n            action_values = {}\\n            for action, target in critical_actions:\\n                action_key\
    \ = f\\\"{action}_{target}\\\"\\n                action_values[action_key] = self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est']\\n            \\n            chosen_action_key = max(action_values, key=action_values.get)\\n            parts = chosen_action_key.split('_')\\n            action_type = parts[0]\\n            target_id = '_'.join(parts[1:])\\n        else: \\n            action_options = []\\n            for res_id in RESOURCES.keys():\\n                if env_world_resources[res_id].amount > 0:\\n                    action_options.append((\\\"gather\\\", res_id))\\n            for comp_id in COMPONENTS.keys():\\n                if not env_world_components[comp_id].ready_for_assembly and \\\\\\n                   all(self.current_resources.get(res_id, 0) >= needed for res_id, needed in COMPONENTS[comp_id][\\\"resources\\\"].items()):\\n                    action_options.append((\\\"craft\\\", comp_id))\\n            for bc_id in env_building_status:\\n                bc = env_building_status[bc_id]\\\
    n                if not bc.assembled and bc.crafted_ready and bc.check_dependencies(env_completed_components_history):\\n                    action_options.append((\\\"assemble\\\", bc_id))\\n            \\n            if action_options:\\n                if np.random.rand() < current_epsilon: \\n                    action_type, target_id = random.choice(action_options)\\n                else: \\n                    action_values = {}\\n                    for action, target in action_options:\\n                        action_key = f\\\"{action}_{target}\\\"\\n                        action_values[action_key] = self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est']\\n                    \\n                    chosen_action_key = max(action_values, key=action_values.get)\\n                    parts = chosen_action_key.split('_')\\n                    action_type = parts[0]\\n                    target_id = '_'.join(parts[1:])\\n            else: \\n                action_type = \\\"gather\\\"\\\
    n                target_id = np.random.choice(list(RESOURCES.keys()))\\n        \\n        return action_type, target_id\\n\\n    def update_learning(self, chosen_action: Tuple[str, str], collective_round_reward: float, world_components: Dict[str, Component], current_max_possible_collective_reward: float, current_round: int):\\n        action_key = f\\\"{chosen_action[0]}_{chosen_action[1]}\\\"\\n        \\n        reward_signal = collective_round_reward / current_max_possible_collective_reward if current_max_possible_collective_reward > 0 else 0.0\\n\\n        self.action_strategy[action_key]['attempts'] += 1 \\n        self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] = np.clip(\\n            (1 - self.learning_rate) * self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] + \\\\\\n            self.learning_rate * reward_signal, 0, 1)\\n\\n    def update_reputation_from_round_outcome(self, collective_round_reward: float, max_possible_collective_reward_this_round: float):\\n        performance_score\
    \ = collective_round_reward / max_possible_collective_reward_this_round if max_possible_collective_reward_this_round > 0 else 0.0\\n\\n        for aid in self.reputations.keys():\\n            self.reputations[aid] = np.clip(\\n                (1 - self.learning_rate) * self.reputations[aid] + \\\\\\n                self.learning_rate * performance_score, 0, 1)\\n\\n    def record_actions(self, action_type: str, target_id: str):\\n        action_key = f\\\"{action_type}_{target_id}\\\"\\n        self.recent_actions[action_key].append(1) \\n        if len(self.recent_actions[action_key]) > self.action_history_window:\\n            self.recent_actions[action_key].pop(0)\\n\\n    def calculate_specialization_index(self, all_possible_action_keys_global: List[str]) -> Tuple[str, float]:\\n        total_actions_in_window = sum(sum(counts) for counts in self.recent_actions.values())\\n        if total_actions_in_window == 0:\\n            self.specialization_index = 0.0\\n            self.most_specialized_action\
    \ = \\\"None\\\"\\n            return \\\"None\\\", 0.0\\n        \\n        action_sums = {ak: sum(counts) for ak, counts in self.recent_actions.items()}\\n        \\n        proportions = np.array([action_sums.get(ak, 0) / total_actions_in_window for ak in all_possible_action_keys_global]) \\n        \\n        positive_proportions = proportions[proportions > 0]\\n        \\n        if len(positive_proportions) > 1:\\n            entropy = -np.sum(positive_proportions * np.log2(positive_proportions))\\n            max_entropy = math.log2(len(positive_proportions)) if len(positive_proportions) > 0 else 0.0\\n            specialization_index = 1 - (entropy / max_entropy) if max_entropy > 0 else 0.0\\n        else:\\n            specialization_index = 1.0 if len(positive_proportions) == 1 else 0.0\\n\\n        most_specialized_action = max(action_sums, key=action_sums.get) if action_sums else \\\"None\\\"\\n        \\n        self.specialization_index = specialization_index\\n       \
    \ self.most_specialized_action = most_specialized_action\\n        return most_specialized_action, specialization_index\\n\\n    def consider_strategy_adoption(self, all_agents: Dict[str, 'ConstructionAgent'], current_round: int, total_rounds: int,\\n                                   adoption_threshold_self_reward_factor: float = 0.5, \\n                                   adoption_threshold_other_rep: float = 0.5, \\n                                   top_n_percent_mentors: float = 0.25, max_possible_collective_reward_per_round: float = 0):\\n        \\n        expected_total_reward_for_current_round = max_possible_collective_reward_per_round * (current_round + 1)\\n        dynamic_self_reward_threshold = expected_total_reward_for_current_round * adoption_threshold_self_reward_factor\\n\\n        if self.total_reward < dynamic_self_reward_threshold: \\n            sorted_agents = sorted(all_agents.values(), key=lambda a: a.total_reward, reverse=True)\\n            num_top_mentors =\
    \ max(1, int(len(self.all_agent_ids) * top_n_percent_mentors))\\n            \\n            potential_mentors = []\\n            for mentor_candidate in sorted_agents[:num_top_mentors]: \\n                if mentor_candidate.agent_id == self.agent_id: continue\\n                \\n                rep_threshold = max(adoption_threshold_other_rep, 0.2) \\n                if self.reputations.get(mentor_candidate.agent_id, 0.0) >= rep_threshold: \\n                    potential_mentors.append(mentor_candidate)\\n            \\n            if potential_mentors:\\n                mentor = max(potential_mentors, key=lambda a: a.total_reward)\\n                \\n                for action_key in set(self.action_strategy.keys()).union(mentor.action_strategy.keys()):\\n                    if action_key in mentor.action_strategy:\\n                        self.action_strategy[action_key]['success'] = mentor.action_strategy[action_key].get('success', 1)\\n                        self.action_strategy[action_key]['attempts']\
    \ = mentor.action_strategy[action_key].get('attempts', 2)\\n                        self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] = mentor.action_strategy[action_key].get('value_est', 0.5)\\n                    elif action_key in self.action_strategy: \\n                        pass \\n                    else: \\n                        self.action_strategy[action_key] = {'success': 1, 'attempts': 2, 'value_est': 0.5}\\n\\n                if np.random.rand() < self.mutation_rate:\\n                    for action_key in self.action_strategy.keys():\\n                        self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] = np.clip(self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] + np.random.uniform(-0.1, 0.1), 0, 1)\\n                \\n                self.epsilon_start = 0.08 \\n\\nclass CooperativeBuildingEnvironment:\\n    def __init__(self, num_agents: int, total_resource_capacity: int = 400):\\n        self.num_agents = num_agents\\n        self.total_resource_capacity = total_resource_capacity\\\
    n        self.world_resources: Dict[str, Resource] = {}\\n        self.world_components: Dict[str, Component] = {} \\n        self.building_status: Dict[str, BuildingComponent] = {} \\n        self.completed_components_history: Dict[str, bool] = {} \\n        self.current_building_phase = \\\"house_phase1\\\" \\n        \\n        for res_id in RESOURCES.keys():\\n            self.world_resources[res_id] = Resource(res_id, amount=self.total_resource_capacity // len(RESOURCES))\\n\\n        for comp_id, blueprint in COMPONENTS.items():\\n            self.world_components[comp_id] = Component(comp_id, blueprint)\\n\\n        self._initialize_building_phase(self.current_building_phase)\\n        \\n        self.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round = 3000 \\n        \\n        print(f\\\"Environment initialized for {num_agents} agents for building task (Phase: {self.current_building_phase}).\\\")\\n\\n    def _initialize_building_phase(self, phase_name: str):\\n        new_phase_building_status\
    \ = {}\\n        for bc_id, deps in BUILDING_PLAN[phase_name]:\\n            new_phase_building_status[bc_id] = BuildingComponent(bc_id, deps)\\n        self.building_status = new_phase_building_status \\n        \\n        print(f\\\"  Initialized Building Phase: {phase_name}\\\")\\n\\n    def _check_phase_complete(self) -> bool:\\n        current_phase_component_ids = [comp_id for comp_id, _ in BUILDING_PLAN[self.current_building_phase]]\\n        \\n        if not all(comp_id in self.building_status for comp_id in current_phase_component_ids):\\n            return False \\n\\n        return all(self.building_status[bc_id].assembled for bc_id in current_phase_component_ids)\\n\\n    def transition_phase(self):\\n        if self._check_phase_complete():\\n            if self.current_building_phase == \\\"house_phase1\\\":\\n                print(\\\"\\\\n--- Phase 1 Complete! Transitioning to Phase 2 ---\\\")\\n                self.current_building_phase = \\\"house_phase2\\\"\\n  \
    \              self._initialize_building_phase(self.current_building_phase)\\n                return True\\n            elif self.current_building_phase == \\\"house_phase2\\\":\\n                print(\\\"\\\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\\")\\n                return True\\n        return False\\n\\n    def introduce_dynamic_event(self, current_round: int):\\n        pass\\n\\n    def get_collective_reward(self) -> float:\\n        total_components_in_current_phase = len(BUILDING_PLAN[self.current_building_phase])\\n        if total_components_in_current_phase == 0: return 0\\n\\n        reward = 0.0\\n        for bc_id, bc in self.building_status.items():\\n            if bc.assembled:\\n                reward += (self.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round * 0.75 / total_components_in_current_phase) \\n        \\n        if self._check_phase_complete():\\n            reward += (self.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round * 0.25) \\n        \\n        return reward\\\
    n\\n    def process_actions(self, agent_actions: Dict[str, Tuple[str, str]], agents_dict: Dict[str, ConstructionAgent]) -> float:\\n        resource_gains = defaultdict(int)\\n        craft_progress = defaultdict(int)\\n        assemble_attempts = defaultdict(lambda: [])\\n\\n        for agent_id, (action_type, target_id) in agent_actions.items():\\n            agent = agents_dict[agent_id]\\n            if action_type == \\\"gather\\\":\\n                if target_id in self.world_resources and self.world_resources[target_id].amount > 0:\\n                    agent.current_resources[target_id] += 1\\n                    self.world_resources[target_id].amount -= 1\\n            elif action_type == \\\"craft\\\":\\n                if target_id in self.world_components:\\n                    can_craft = True\\n                    for res_id, needed in COMPONENTS[target_id][\\\"resources\\\"].items():\\n                        if agent.current_resources.get(res_id, 0) < needed:\\n     \
    \                       can_craft = False\\n                            break\\n                    if can_craft and not self.world_components[target_id].ready_for_assembly:\\n                        for res_id, needed in COMPONENTS[target_id][\\\"resources\\\"].items():\\n                            agent.current_resources[res_id] -= needed\\n                        craft_progress[target_id] += 1 \\n            elif action_type == \\\"assemble\\\":\\n                if target_id in self.building_status and not self.building_status[target_id].assembled:\\n                    assemble_attempts[target_id].append(agent_id) \\n\\n        for comp_id, progress in craft_progress.items():\\n            self.world_components[comp_id].add_craft_time(progress)\\n\\n        for bc_id, bc in self.building_status.items():\\n            bc.check_crafted_ready(self.world_components)\\n\\n        for bc_id, agent_ids in assemble_attempts.items():\\n            bc = self.building_status[bc_id]\\n   \
    \         if bc.crafted_ready and bc.check_dependencies(self.completed_components_history): \\n                if not bc.assembled: \\n                    bc.assemble()\\n                    self.completed_components_history[bc_id] = True \\n\\n        return self.get_collective_reward()\\n\\n    def get_all_possible_action_keys(self) -> List[str]: \\n        actions = []\\n        for res_id in RESOURCES.keys():\\n            actions.append(f\\\"gather_{res_id}\\\")\\n        for comp_id in COMPONENTS.keys():\\n            actions.append(f\\\"craft_{comp_id}\\\")\\n        for bc_id in self.building_status.keys(): \\n            actions.append(f\\\"assemble_{bc_id}\\\")\\n        return actions\\n        \\n    def get_all_possible_action_keys_global(self) -> List[str]: \\n        actions = []\\n        for res_id in RESOURCES.keys():\\n            actions.append(f\\\"gather_{res_id}\\\")\\n        for comp_id in COMPONENTS.keys():\\n            actions.append(f\\\"craft_{comp_id}\\\
    \")\\n        \\n        all_bc_ids_defined = set()\\n        for phase_name in BUILDING_PLAN:\\n            for bc_id, _ in BUILDING_PLAN[phase_name]:\\n                all_bc_ids_defined.add(bc_id)\\n        for bc_id in all_bc_ids_defined:\\n            actions.append(f\\\"assemble_{bc_id}\\\")\\n        return actions\\n\\n# --- Simulation Setup ---\\nNUM_AGENTS = 5\\nNUM_ROUNDS = 2000 \\nTOTAL_RESOURCE_CAPACITY = 400 \\n\\nall_agent_ids = [f\\\"Agent_{i+1}\\\" for i in range(NUM_AGENTS)]\\n\\n# ANCESTOR STRATEGY FROM Eval ID: 443 (Simulated extraction - final state of Generation 2)\\nancestor_strategies_from_eval443 = {\\n    \\\"Agent_1\\\": {\\\"gather_wood\\\": {'value_est': 0.98}, \\\"craft_foundation\\\":{'value_est':0.4}, \\\"assemble_wall_segment_1\\\":{'value_est':0.4}},\\n    \\\"Agent_2\\\": {\\\"gather_metal\\\": {'value_est': 0.98}, \\\"craft_wall_segment\\\":{'value_est':0.4}},\\n    \\\"Agent_3\\\": {\\\"gather_stone\\\": {'value_est': 0.98}, \\\"assemble_roof_panel_1\\\
    \":{'value_est':0.4}},\\n    \\\"Agent_4\\\": {\\\"craft_wall_segment\\\": {'value_est': 0.98}, \\\"assemble_wall_segment_1\\\":{'value_est':0.4}},\\n    \\\"Agent_5\\\": {\\\"craft_foundation\\\": {'value_est': 0.98}, \\\"assemble_roof_panel_1\\\":{'value_est':0.4}},\\n}\\n\\ntemp_env_for_global_actions = CooperativeBuildingEnvironment(NUM_AGENTS, total_resource_capacity=TOTAL_RESOURCE_CAPACITY)\\nall_possible_base_actions_global = temp_env_for_global_actions.get_all_possible_action_keys_global() \\n\\nfull_ancestor_strategies = defaultdict(dict)\\nfor agent_id, strat_dict in ancestor_strategies_from_eval443.items():\\n    for action_key in all_possible_base_actions_global:\\n        full_ancestor_strategies[agent_id][action_key] = {'success': 1, 'attempts': 2, 'value_est': 0.1}\\n    for action_key, values in strat_dict.items():\\n        if 'value_est' in values:\\n            full_ancestor_strategies[agent_id][action_key]['value_est'] = values['value_est']\\n\\ncurrent_generation_id\
    \ = 3 \\n\\nagents_dict = {}\\n\\nfor i, aid in enumerate(all_agent_ids):\\n    ancestor_agent_id = f\\\"Agent_{i+1}\\\" \\n    inherited_strategy_for_descendant = full_ancestor_strategies.get(ancestor_agent_id)\\n    \\n    agents_dict[aid] = ConstructionAgent(aid, all_agent_ids, NUM_AGENTS, \\n                                         learning_rate=0.35, epsilon_start=0.1, epsilon_end=0.005, mutation_rate=0.05, \\n                                         inherited_strategy=inherited_strategy_for_descendant,\\n                                         all_possible_actions_global=all_possible_base_actions_global) \\n\\nenv = CooperativeBuildingEnvironment(NUM_AGENTS, total_resource_capacity=TOTAL_RESOURCE_CAPACITY)\\nall_possible_action_keys_global = env.get_all_possible_action_keys_global() \\n\\nprint(f\\\"\\\\n--- Starting {NUM_ROUNDS} Rounds of Transgenerational Building Task (Generation {current_generation_id}) ---\\\")\\n\\nfor i in range(NUM_ROUNDS):\\n    if env.transition_phase():\\\
    n        pass \\n\\n    agent_actions_this_round = {}\\n    for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\\n        agent_actions_this_round[agent_id] = agents_dict[agent_id].choose_action(\\n            all_possible_action_keys_global, i, NUM_ROUNDS, env.world_resources, \\n            env.world_components, env.building_status, env.completed_components_history\\n        )\\n    \\n    collective_round_reward = env.process_actions(agent_actions_this_round, agents_dict)\\n    \\n    for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\\n        agent = agents_dict[agent_id]\\n        agent.total_reward += collective_round_reward / NUM_AGENTS \\n        \\n        action_key = f\\\"{agent_actions_this_round[agent_id][0]}_{agent_actions_this_round[agent_id][1]}\\\"\\n        \\n        reward_signal = collective_round_reward / env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round if env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round > 0 else 0.0\\n\\n        agent.action_strategy[action_key]['attempts'] += 1 \\n        agent.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est']\
    \ = np.clip(\\n            (1 - agent.learning_rate) * agent.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] + \\\\\\n            agent.learning_rate * reward_signal, 0, 1)\\n\\n        performance_score = collective_round_reward / env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round if env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round > 0 else 0.0\\n\\n        for aid_rep in agent.reputations.keys(): \\n            agent.reputations[aid_rep] = np.clip(\\n                (1 - agent.learning_rate) * agent.reputations[aid_rep] + \\\\\\n                agent.learning_rate * performance_score, 0, 1)\\n                \\n        agent.record_actions(agent_actions_this_round[agent_id][0], agent_actions_this_round[agent_id][1])\\n        agent.calculate_specialization_index(all_possible_action_keys_global) \\n        \\n    if (i + 1) % 100 == 0:\\n        print(f\\\"\\\\n--- Cultural Transmission Check (Round {i+1}, Generation {current_generation_id}) ---\\\")\\n        for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\\n     \
    \       dynamic_self_reward_threshold_for_adoption = (collective_round_reward / env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round) * 0.75 if env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round > 0 else 0\\n\\n            agents_dict[agent_id].consider_strategy_adoption(all_agents=agents_dict, current_round=i, total_rounds=NUM_ROUNDS,\\n                                                           adoption_threshold_self_reward_factor=dynamic_self_reward_threshold_for_adoption,\\n                                                           adoption_threshold_other_rep=0.5, \\n                                                           top_n_percent_mentors=0.25, max_possible_collective_reward_per_round=env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round)\\n\\n        print(f\\\"\\\\nRound {i+1} Summary (Current Phase: {env.current_building_phase}, Collective Reward: {collective_round_reward}, Epsilon_A1: {agents_dict['Agent_1']._get_epsilon(i, NUM_ROUNDS):.2f}, Epsilon_A3: {agents_dict['Agent_3']._get_epsilon(i,\
    \ NUM_ROUNDS):.2f}):\\\")\\n        for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\\n            agent = agents_dict[agent_id]\\n            print(f\\\"  {agent.agent_id} (Gen {current_generation_id}): Total Reward = {agent.total_reward}\\\")\\n            print(f\\\"    Specialization: Most={agent.most_specialized_action}, Index={agent.specialization_index:.2f}\\\")\\n            for rep_partner_id, rep_score in agent.reputations.items():\\n                print(f\\\"    Rep for {rep_partner_id}: {rep_score:.2f}\\\")\\n        \\n        print(\\\"  Current Building Status (Active Phase):\\\")\\n        for bc_id, bc in env.building_status.items():\\n            print(f\\\"    - {bc_id}: Crafted Ready={bc.crafted_ready}, Assembled={bc.assembled}\\\")\\n        print(\\\"  Completed Components (Global History):\\\")\\n        for bc_id, status in env.completed_components_history.items():\\n            if status:\\n                print(f\\\"    - {bc_id}: Assembled={status}\\\")\\n\\nprint(f\\\"\\\\\
    n--- Simulation Complete (Generation {current_generation_id}) ---\\\")\\nprint(\\\"\\\\nFinal Agent Rewards:\\\")\\nfor agent_id in all_agent_ids:\\n    agent = agents_dict[agent_id]\\n    print(f\\\"  {agent.agent_id} (Gen {current_generation_id}): Total Reward = {agent.total_reward}\\\")\\n    print(f\\\"    Specialization: Most={agent.most_specialized_action}, Index={agent.specialization_index:.2f}\\\")\\n    for rep_partner_id, rep_score in agent.reputations.items():\\n        print(f\\\"    Rep for {rep_partner_id}: {rep_score:.2f}\\\")\\n\\nfinal_collective_reward_sum_of_totals = sum(agent.total_reward for agent in agents_dict.values())\\nprint(f\\\"Final Collective Reward (sum of individual totals): {final_collective_reward_sum_of_totals}\\\")\\n\\nprint(\\\"\\\\nFinal Building Status (Global History):\\\")\\nfor bc_id, status in env.completed_components_history.items():\\n    if status:\\n        print(f\\\"  - {bc_id}: Assembled={status}\\\")\\nprint(f\\\"Final Building Phase:\
    \ {env.current_building_phase}\\\")\\n\",\n    \"execution_log\": \"PYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\\nSTDOUT:\\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\\n  Initialized Building Phase: house_phase1\\nEnvironment initialized for 5 agents for building task (Phase: house_phase1).\\nConstruction Agent Agent_1 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\\nConstruction Agent Agent_2 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\\nConstruction Agent Agent_3 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\\nConstruction Agent Agent_4 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\\nConstruction Agent Agent_5 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\\n  Initialized Building Phase: house_phase1\\nEnvironment initialized for 5 agents for building task (Phase: house_phase1).\\n\\n--- Starting 2000 Rounds of Transgenerational Building Task (Generation 3) ---\\n\\n--- Phase 1 Complete! Transitioning\
