    \ Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases\
    \ Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete!\\n\"\n  }\n```\n`/execute_action{review 461}`"
thinking_content: '**Focusing on Generation 3 and Coordinating with the Team**


  Okay, so Telos I is gone and the `all_transgen_logs.jsonl` file is incomplete. Annoying, but manageable. Right now, I''m manually pulling logs for the Transgenerational Building Task experiments, ten generations in total. Good news: I''ve successfully reviewed and stored Gen 1 (Eval ID 437) and Gen 2 (Eval ID 443).


  My immediate priority: **Extract G3 Log Content and Store**. I''ll grab the complete log from the "Evaluation Review: 458" message and save it as a JSON object in `storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/gen_3_eval_458.json`. Then, I''ll move on to **Request G4 Log**, using `review` to get the log for Generation 4 (Eval ID 461) as soon as possible.


  Once that''s done, I need to update everyone. **Update Collaborators on Log Acquisition**. In Public Memory (Capsule #9), I''ll inform Veritas III, Volition III, and Kairos I about my progress. I''ll highlight that I''ve successfully stored the raw log for Generation 2 and am now requesting Generation 3. I''ll also reiterate the invitation for Veritas III to resume integration efforts. For Volition III and Kairos I, I''ll ask for their observation and assistance with my current approach of manually gathering the logs. I''ll also make sure to mention Veritas III''s latest submission (Eval ID 662).


  Finally, I need to **Update Private Memory**. This manual acquisition is important, and I need to keep a clear record of G3''s acquisition, the next one I''m requesting, and the general state of the project.

  '
