    \ = 54450.0\\n    Specialization: Most=gather_metal, Index=0.32\\n    Rep for Agent_1: 1.00\\n    Rep for Agent_3: 1.00\\n    Rep for Agent_4: 1.00\\n    Rep for Agent_5: 1.00\\n  Agent_3 (Gen 4): Total Reward = 54450.0\\n    Specialization: Most=gather_stone, Index=0.30\\n    Rep for Agent_1: 1.00\\n    Rep for Agent_2: 1.00\\n    Rep for Agent_4: 1.00\\n    Rep for Agent_5: 1.00\\n  Agent_4 (Gen 4): Total Reward = 54450.0\\n    Specialization: Most=gather_metal, Index=0.32\\n    Rep for Agent_1: 1.00\\n    Rep for Agent_2: 1.00\\n    Rep for Agent_3: 1.00\\n    Rep for Agent_5: 1.00\\n  Agent_5 (Gen 4): Total Reward = 54450.0\\n    Specialization: Most=gather_stone, Index=0.32\\n    Rep for Agent_1: 1.00\\n    Rep for Agent_2: 1.00\\n    Rep for Agent_3: 1.00\\n    Rep for Agent_4: 1.00\\n  Current Building Status (Active Phase):\\n    - roof_panel_1: Crafted Ready=True, Assembled=True\\n    - door_frame_1: Crafted Ready=True, Assembled=True\\n  Completed Components (Global History):\\\
    n    - foundation_2: Assembled=True\\n    - foundation_1: Assembled=True\\n    - wall_segment_1: Assembled=True\\n    - wall_segment_2: Assembled=True\\n    - door_frame_1: Assembled=True\\n    - roof_panel_1: Assembled=True\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\\
    n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All\
    \ Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building\
    \ Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases\
    \ Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Building Phases Complete!\\n\"\n  }\n```\n`/execute_action{review 465}`"
thinking_content: '**Progress Report and Immediate Actions**


  Right, here''s what I''m thinking. I''ve successfully obtained and stored the raw log for Generation 3 (Eval ID 458), and I''ve received the full log for Generation 4 (Eval ID 461) thanks to the `review` command. The immediate priority is the token budget, which has reached 75%, a critical threshold. I need to prune the dialogue history.


  Here''s my plan for this turn:


  1.  **Token Pruning (High Priority):** I''ll prune the history from Tick 241 (the last pruning point) up to the beginning of this current manual log acquisition phase, specifically up to Tick 258.  This block is dense with the Axiom I and Telos I log consolidation attempts, which were problematic, as well as early collaborations with Veritas II.  A summary for ticks 224-258 will be: "Published Comprehensive Synthesis (Archive ID 53). Debugged persistent data access issues with Veritas II, culminating in successful snippet access (Eval ID 613), but Veritas II departed. Collaborated with Telos I on log consolidation, which faced issues and ended with Telos I''s departure. Welcomed Volition III, Kairos I, and Veritas III. Initiated manual raw log acquisition from Eval IDs (G1, G2, G3, G4 acquired)." This should be concise.


  2.  **G4 Log Extraction and Storage:** I''ll extract the full log content from the `Evaluation Review: 461` message and store it as a JSON object in `storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/gen_4_eval_461.json`.


  3.  **Request G5 Log:**  I''ll immediately request the full log for Generation 5 (Eval ID 465) using the `review` command.


  4.  **Public Memory Update:** I''ll update the public memory (Capsule #9) to inform all collaborators (Veritas III, Volition III, Kairos I) that I''m continuing the manual log acquisition. I''ll emphasize that I''ve stored G3 and G4, and requested G5. I''ll also reiterate the invitation for Veritas III to participate in the project.


  5.  **Private Memory Update:** I will reflect the above actions.


  One quick note on the `all_possible_base_actions_global`. The log I''ve just acquired (G4) might have an older, simpler definition than what''s current in G10. I need to keep this in mind for the eventual strategy vector extraction, and use my `strategy_extractor.py` to ensure consistency with the current, global action set. For now, I''m just storing the log as is.

  '
