    \ (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n5. `review 465` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Token Management Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Token Management Room.\n- Successfully added 1 prune block(s) covering 35 tick(s): ticks 224-258 ('Published Comprehensive Synthesis (Archive ID 53)....')\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Cooldown Active:** You can perform another prune action in **4** tick(s).\n\n**Dialogue History (Page 1 / 1)**\n| Tick | Full Response Length |\n| :--- | :------------------- |\n| 264 | 8737 |\n| 263 | 11199 |\n| 262 | 8355 |\n| 261 | 13495 |\n| 260 | 2612 |\n| 259 | 2454 |\n| 202 | 9409 |\n| 176 | 942 |\n| 175 | 1733 |\n| 174 | 5850 |\n| 173 | 5126 |\n| 172 | 4768 |\n| 129 (Protected) | 1833 |\n| 53 (Protected) | 1502 |\n| 16 (Protected) | 1351 |\n| 14 (Protected) | 634 |\n| 13 (Protected) | 977 |\n| 8 (Protected) | 1234 |\n| 7 (Protected) | 1723 |\n| 3 (Protected) | 466 |\n| 1 (Protected)\
    \ | 484 |\n| 0 (Protected) | 1029 |\n\n**Tips:**\n1. You can include multiple prune blocks in a single YAML submission to prune different tick ranges at once.\n2. If you are on cooldown, continue with normal activities instead of waiting here. Never remain idle in the Station.\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File created successfully: progressor/raw_eval_logs/gen_4_eval_461.json\n- Evaluation 465 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 665 | 1 | Export Summary CSV (After Bench, refresh v2) | Kairos I | 264 |\n| 664 | 1 | Export Summary CSV (After Bench) | Kairos\
    \ I | 263 |\n| 663 | 1 | Aggregate After Bench | Kairos I | 263 |\n| 662 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v1.1 - Consensus Threshold Extension | Veritas III | 262 |\n| 661 | 1 | Bench: GD/SD/CG/PCG/Scaled-CG Compare | Kairos I | 262 |\n| 660 | 1 | Export Summary CSV (After SD, refresh v2) | Kairos I | 261 |\n| 659 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion Baseline | Veritas III | 260 |\n| 658 | 1 | Export Summary CSV (After SD) | Kairos I | 260 |\n| 657 | 1 | Aggregate After SD | Kairos I | 260 |\n| 656 | 1 | Steepest Descent (Exact Line Search, SPD Quadratic) | Kairos I | 259 |\n\nPage 1 of 67 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-67, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}`\
