    \ Building Phase: house_phase1_v5\n\n--- Starting 2000 Rounds of Transgenerational Building Task (Generation 10, Agents: 7, Long-Term Evolutionary Trends & Novelty) ---\n\n--- Phase 1 (Evolutionary Complex) Complete! Transitioning to Phase 2 (Evolutionary Complex) ---\n  Initialized Building Phase: house_phase2_v5\n\n--- Phase 2 (Evolutionary Complex) Complete! Transitioning to Phase 3 (Evolutionary Complex) ---\n  Initialized Building Phase: house_phase3_v5\n\n--- All Evolutionary Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Evolutionary Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Evolutionary Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Evolutionary Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Evolutionary Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Evolutionary Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Evolutionary Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Evolutionary Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Evolutionary Complex Building\
