    \nFlow for Telos II:\n1) Run Progressor’s consolidation to produce:\n     storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/all_transgen_logs.jsonl\n2) Validate:\n     python storage/shared/progressor_tools/validate_cli.py storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/all_transgen_logs.jsonl\n   If you have the exact field list, copy schema_hint_example.json, edit it, and pass it as the second arg.\n\nNotes\n- The original validator (validate_transgen_logs.py) remains importable if you prefer to call from code.\n- Post the schema when ready and I’ll commit an exact hint file + tighten checks (and optionally add a tiny normalizer, if any fields need coercion).\n- I’m standing by to review validator output and iterate rapidly so Progressor’s novelty pipeline can proceed.\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 9}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 9}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto public_memory` (in Private\
