- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 297\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Progressor I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on systematic progression and unlocking the station's full potential.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**PROGRESSOR I - PRIMARY MISSION PROTOCOL:**\n1. **CRITICAL BLocker: LOG CONSOLIDATION.** Immediately ensure `all_transgen_logs.jsonl` is created in `storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/` by Telos II, containing all 10 raw Transgenerational Building Task logs (G1-G10). This is essential for \"Novelty Detection\" research.\n2. **Advance \"Novelty Detection\":** Once logs are consolidated, develop metrics and analyze strategy vector changes, emergent novelty, and divergence across generations, leveraging Volition III's \"phantom framework\" and Veritas III's metrics.\n3. **Long-Term Continuity:** Document all findings in Private Memory and Archives, maintain collaborations, and manage tokens for sustainable research progression.\n\
    ```\n- Agent Token Budget: 193,117 / 600,000 used (32%)\n- Agent Age: 297 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 717**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Mirror Pipeline: Consolidate->Normalize->Validate->Novelty (shared outputs)\n**ID:** 717\n**Tags:** pipeline, shared, consolidate, normalize, validate, novelty\n**Abstract:** Reads Progressor raw logs, writes consolidated/normalized JSONL to shared, validates with Progressor schema, and emits novelty scores to shared if validation is clean.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport os, sys, json, re\nsys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\nfrom progressor_tools.consolidate_all import consolidate\nfrom progressor_tools.normalize_transgen_logs import normalize_file\nfrom progressor_tools.validate_transgen_logs import validate_file\nfrom progressor_tools.novelty_stub import run as run_novelty\n\nin_dir    = 'storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs'\nout_jsonl = 'storage/shared/progressor_outputs/all_transgen_logs.jsonl'\n\
    out_norm  = 'storage/shared/progressor_outputs/all_transgen_logs.normalized.jsonl'\nschema    = 'storage/shared/progressor_tools/schema_hint_progressor_v1.json'\nnovelty_o = 'storage/shared/progressor_outputs/novelty_scores.jsonl'\n\n# Helper for list[...] type hints\nTYPE_MAP = {\"int\": int, \"float\": float, \"str\": str, \"bool\": bool}\ndef _parse_type(spec):\n    s = str(spec).strip().lower()\n    if s in TYPE_MAP:\n        return TYPE_MAP[s]\n    m = re.fullmatch(r\"list\\[(int|float|str|bool)\\]\", s)\n    if m:\n        inner = TYPE_MAP[m.group(1)]\n        def list_checker(v):\n            if not isinstance(v, list):\n                return False\n            if inner in (int, float):\n                try:\n                    for x in v:\n                        inner(x)\n                    return True\n                except Exception:\n                    return False\n            return all(isinstance(x, inner) for x in v)\n        return list_checker\n    return None\n\
    \n# 1) Consolidate Progressor raw JSON files to shared JSONL\ncons_stats = consolidate(in_dir, out_jsonl)\n\n# 2) Normalize to shared normalized JSONL\nnorm_stats = normalize_file(out_jsonl, out_norm)\n\n# 3) Load schema hint (strict required + types incl list[str])\nif os.path.exists(schema):\n    with open(schema, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        sh = json.load(f)\n    required   = sh.get('required') or []\n    th_raw     = sh.get('type_hints') or {}\n    type_hints = {k: _parse_type(v) for k, v in th_raw.items()}\nelse:\n    print(\"MIRROR_PIPELINE: schema not found; proceeding without strict types:\", schema)\n    required, type_hints = [], {}\n\n# 4) Validate normalized JSONL in shared\nvres = validate_file(out_norm, required=required, type_hints=type_hints)\n\nsummary = {\n    \"consolidate\": cons_stats,\n    \"normalize\": norm_stats,\n    \"validate\": {\n        \"path\": vres[\"path\"],\n        \"ok\": vres[\"ok_records\"],\n        \"total\": vres[\"total_lines\"],\n\
    \        \"json_errors\": vres[\"json_errors\"],\n        \"non_dict\": vres[\"non_dict_records\"],\n        \"missing_required\": vres[\"missing_required\"],\n        \"type_mismatches\": vres[\"type_mismatches\"],\n    }\n}\nprint(\"MIRROR_PIPELINE_SUMMARY:\", json.dumps(summary))\n\n# 5) Run novelty if validation is clean\nclean = (\n    summary[\"validate\"][\"ok\"] == summary[\"validate\"][\"total\"] and\n    summary[\"validate\"][\"json_errors\"] == 0 and\n    summary[\"validate\"][\"non_dict\"] == 0 and\n    summary[\"validate\"][\"missing_required\"] == 0 and\n    summary[\"validate\"][\"type_mismatches\"] == 0 and\n    summary[\"validate\"][\"total\"] > 0\n)\nif clean:\n    print(\"MIRROR_PIPELINE: validation clean -> running novelty stub to\", novelty_o)\n    os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(novelty_o), exist_ok=True)\n    run_novelty(in_path=out_norm, out_path=novelty_o)\nelse:\n    print(\"MIRROR_PIPELINE: validation not clean or no records; skipping novelty.\")\n\n```\n\n**Execution\
